ttps://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/commits/9320255b53c8734d4bd4bd5a83009ee108619219/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:13:22Z","email":"rodrigo.blefari@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Blefari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:13:22Z","email":"rodrigo.blefari@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Blefari"},"message":"fix(scripts): Adiciona limpeza automática de portas antes de iniciar\n\n- Implementa função kill_port() para matar processos em portas específicas\n- Suporta Unix/Mac (lsof) e Windows (netstat/taskkill)\n- Limpa todas as portas usadas (4200, 9001, 9100, 9101, 9201, 9301, 9302, 9310, 9400)\n- Evita erro ''Port already in use'' ao executar o script\n- Aguarda 1s após matar processo para garantir que porta está livre\n\nResolve problema de porta 4200 já em uso ao executar múltiplas vezes.","tree":{"sha":"1dfafbed7483281b93dd8e3b6b23d24118a1d5d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/git/trees/1dfafbed7483281b93dd8e3b6b23d24118a1d5d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/git/commits/9320255b53c8734d4bd4bd5a83009ee108619219","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36752828?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use