hub.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/commits/13843ad3cc4b1e2dc96fb17f60da0efae1570c7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:12:00Z","email":"rodrigo.blefari@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Blefari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:12:00Z","email":"rodrigo.blefari@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Blefari"},"message":"feat(angular-shell): Implementa ranking completo com telemetria científica e integração Cloudflare\n\n✨ Funcionalidades implementadas:\n\n🔬 Benchmark Científico:\n- 5 rodadas cold cache + 5 rodadas warm cache por MFE\n- Simulação de ambiente real com delays para GC\n- Limpeza estratégica de cache entre cenários\n- Modal animado com progresso detalhado\n- Medições precisas usando Performance API\n\n📊 Telemetria Completa:\n- Tabela profissional com 10 colunas de métricas\n- Ordenação clicável em todas as colunas (▲/▼)\n- Classes de performance com cores (ok/caution/warn)\n- Linha de resumo com estatísticas globais\n- Legenda visual de performance\n\n🔍 Análise Avançada:\n- Detecção automática de framework\n- Análise de export contracts\n- Classificação de remote entry\n- Medição de bundle size com cache inteligente\n- Análise de dependências compartilhadas\n\n🌐 Integração Cloudflare:\n- Scripts atualizados para criar túneis automaticamente\n- Geração automática de remotes.public.json para ambos shells\n- Suporte para cloudflared local e global\n\n🎨 UI/UX:\n- Checkboxes para seleção de MFEs\n- Botões Todos/Nenhum para seleção rápida\n- Botões: Benchmark Científico, Limpar Cache, Limpar Palco\n- Design responsivo e profissional\n\n📝 Arquivos modificados:\n- angular-shell-20/src/app/components/shell-layout/*\n- run-angular-shell-all.sh\n- expose-public.sh","tree":{"sha":"8cc1bf4cb3fd90768b2fcf0d05356f530d9af238","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/git/trees/8cc1bf4cb3fd90768b2fcf0d05356f530d9af238"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/git/commits/13843ad3cc4b1e2dc96fb17f60da0efae1570c7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36752828?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoBlefari","id":36752828,"login":"RodrigoBlefari","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzUyODI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoBlefari","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/commit/13843ad3cc4b1e2dc96fb17f60da0efae1570c7a","node_id":"C_kwDOQLVL2NoAKDEzODQzYWQzY2M0YjFlMmRjOTZmYjE3ZjYwZGEwZWZhZTE1NzBjN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/commit/786e32ac22a5f10cc1ebb13005b3afd2f3d58d22","sha":"786e32ac22a5f10cc1ebb13005b3afd2f3d58d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoBlefari/MFE-LABS/commits/786e32ac22a5f10cc1ebb13005b3afd2f3d58d22"