"buub1309120@gmail.com","name":"huynhgiabuu"},"message":"feat(scripts): add SRS-driven leetcode-review picker\n\nscripts/leetcode-review.mjs scans every problem .md in docs/leetcode/\n(excluding _archive/) and surfaces what''s due based on YAML frontmatter\nfields: status, confidence, last_reviewed, srs_dates, frequency_tier.\n\nBuckets: OVERDUE, DUE_TODAY, UPCOMING (7d), UNSOLVED, FUTURE.\n\nModes:\n  (default)             full bucket report\n  --pick                surface ONE problem now (prioritises overdue → due → unsolved)\n  --due-only            hide UPCOMING + UNSOLVED sections\n  --category <name>     filter by top-level category folder\n  --company <name>      filter by company tag\n  --json                machine-readable output\n  --limit N             cap rows per section (default 25)\n\nZero deps, pure Node ≥18. Read-only — never mutates frontmatter.\nCaller updates status/confidence/srs_dates manually per RULES.md v2.0.","tree":{"sha":"a8cc4ec788332c198c5900cd632a857da4a44dac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nhi4912/interview-2025/git/trees/a8cc4ec788332c198c5900cd632a857da4a44dac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nhi4912/interview-2025/git/commits/d8aca1dfefe446107e578cadfcd10fc3416cb732","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111694395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyhuynhgiabuu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyhuynhgiabuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyhuynhgiabuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyhuynhgiabuu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/heyhuynhgiabuu","id":111694395,"login":"heyhuynhgiabuu","node_id":"U_kgDOBqhSOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyhuynhgiabuu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyhuynhgiabuu/recei