ceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/e460c8db5c74f763c528fb50501f9ac207004f21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T12:21:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T12:21:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(ui-solid): prevent infinite loop by checking value equality before updates\n\n**Critical Fix**: Added deep equality check in handlePropertyChange to prevent\ninfinite loops when property editors call onChange with the same value.\n\n**Root Cause:**\nProperty editors (BorderEditor, SpacingEditor, CSSValueInput) call onChange\ninternally when they receive props, even if the value hasn''t changed. This\ncaused an infinite loop:\n1. Editor receives DEFAULT_BORDER (component has no border yet)\n2. Editor calls onChange(DEFAULT_BORDER)\n3. handlePropertyChange updates the component\n4. Re-render passes same value to editor\n5. Editor calls onChange again\n6. Loop continues → stack overflow\n\n**Solution:**\nAdded JSON.stringify deep equality check before calling props.onPropertyChange:\n```typescript\nconst currentValue = getNestedValue(props.selectedComponent, property.key);\nif (JSON.stringify(currentValue) === JSON.stringify(value)) {\n  return; // Value hasn''t changed, skip update\n}\n```\n\nThis breaks the loop:\n- First time: undefined !== DEFAULT_BORDER → update happens\n- Second time: DEFAULT_BORDER === DEFAULT_BORDER → early return, no update\n\n**Impact:**\n- Prevents infinite onChange loops for object-based properties\n- Stops \"Cannot mutate a Store directly\" warnings\n- Eliminates \"Maximum call stack size exceeded\" errors\n- Only triggers updates when values actually change\n\n**Files Changed:**\n- packages/ui-solid/src/sidebar/PropertyPanel.tsx:\n  - Added deep equality check in handlePropertyChange\n  - Removed unnecessary setNestedValue call (unused updatedComponent)\n\nTesting: All packages build successfully.","tree":{"sha":"8463a34ba12be3de652f6fe74d3271fda154d8bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/8463a34ba12be3de652f6fe74d3271fda154d8bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/e460c8db5c74f763c528fb50501f9ac207004f21","verification":{"payload":"tree 8463a34ba12be3de652f6fe74d3271fda154d8bc\nparent c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763382088 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763382088 +0000\n\nfix(ui-solid): prevent infinite loop by checking value equality before updates\n\n**Critical Fix**: Added deep equality check in handlePropertyChange to prevent\ninfinite loops when property editors call onChange with the same value.\n\n**Root Cause:**\nProperty editors (BorderEditor, SpacingEditor, CSSValueInput) call onChange\ninternally when they receive props, even if the value hasn''t changed. This\ncaused an infinite loop:\n1. Editor receives DEFAULT_BORDER (component has no border yet)\n2. Editor calls onChange(DEFAULT_BORDER)\n3. handlePropertyChange updates the component\n4. Re-render passes same value to editor\n5. Editor calls onChange again\n6. Loop continues → stack overflow\n\n**Solution:**\nAdded JSON.stringify deep equality check before calling props.onPropertyChange:\n```typescript\nconst currentValue = getNestedValue(props.selectedComponent, property.key);\nif (JSON.stringify(currentValue) === JSON.stringify(value)) {\n  return; // Value hasn''t changed, skip update\n}\n```\n\nThis breaks the loop:\n- First time: undefined !== DEFAULT_BORDER → update happens\n- Second time: DEFAULT_BORDER === DEFAULT_BORDER → early return, no update\n\n**Impact:**\n- Prevents infinite onChange loops for object-based properties\n- Stops \"Cannot mutate a Store directly\" warnings\n- Eliminates \"Maximum call stack size exceeded\" errors\n- Only triggers updates when values actually change\n\n**Files Changed:**\n- packages/ui-solid/src/sidebar/PropertyPanel.tsx:\n  - Added deep equality check in handlePropertyChange\n  - Removed unnecessary setNestedValue call (unused updatedComponent)\n\nTesting: All packages build successfully.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM3C+0aG\n2dOt5Xn5IFNaRDlDGAoH43tnOUs9wbuIIXmKLbJbHjeVVCt4bhooxrO+DwqS+HmiBzJxp0cdONkl\nXw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-17T12:21:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/e460c8db5c74f763c528fb50501f9ac207004f21","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKGU0NjBjOGRiNWM3NGY3NjNjNTI4ZmI1MDUwMWY5YWMyMDcwMDRmMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489","sha":"c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489"}],"sha":"e460c8db5c74f763c528fb50501f9ac207004f21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/e460c8db5c74f763c528fb50501f9ac207004f21"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T12:07:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T12:07:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(ui-solid): prevent infinite loop in PropertyPanel by using stable defaults\n\n**Critical Bug Fix**: Resolved \"Maximum call stack exceeded\" error when\nentering the style tab of component properties.\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe PropertyPanel was creating new object literals on every render for\nborder, cssvalue, and spacing property editors. When these components\nreceived a new value prop reference (even with identical values), they\nwould trigger onChange callbacks, which attempted to update the SolidJS\nstore, causing \"Cannot mutate a Store directly\" warnings and infinite loops.\n\n**Solution:**\n1. Created stable default value constants outside the component:\n   - DEFAULT_CSS_VALUE: { value: 0, unit: ''px'' }\n   - DEFAULT_BORDER: Complete border configuration with radius\n   - DEFAULT_SPACING: All four sides with default values\n\n2. Updated property editor cases to use these stable constants:\n   - cssvalue: Uses DEFAULT_CSS_VALUE instead of inline literal\n   - border: Uses DEFAULT_BORDER instead of inline literal\n   - spacing: Uses DEFAULT_SPACING instead of inline literal\n\n**Impact:**\n- Prevents object literal creation on every render\n- Stops infinite onChange → render → onChange loops\n- Eliminates \"Cannot mutate a Store directly\" warnings\n- Resolves \"Maximum call stack exceeded\" errors\n\n**Files Changed:**\n- packages/ui-solid/src/sidebar/PropertyPanel.tsx:\n  - Added 3 stable default constants before component export\n  - Updated 3 switch cases to use stable defaults\n\nTesting: Build passes successfully, no TypeScript errors.","tree":{"sha":"024cbde994c8f7971fcbd8ce26c9e7978b682a06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/024cbde994c8f7971fcbd8ce26c9e7978b682a06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489","verification":{"payload":"tree 024cbde994c8f7971fcbd8ce26c9e7978b682a06\nparent 2f87db58d7ecda2b5c6b98d6f939aeea29bd631a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763381253 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763381253 +0000\n\nfix(ui-solid): prevent infinite loop in PropertyPanel by using stable defaults\n\n**Critical Bug Fix**: Resolved \"Maximum call stack exceeded\" error when\nentering the style tab of component properties.\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe PropertyPanel was creating new object literals on every render for\nborder, cssvalue, and spacing property editors. When these components\nreceived a new value prop reference (even with identical values), they\nwould trigger onChange callbacks, which attempted to update the SolidJS\nstore, causing \"Cannot mutate a Store directly\" warnings and infinite loops.\n\n**Solution:**\n1. Created stable default value constants outside the component:\n   - DEFAULT_CSS_VALUE: { value: 0, unit: ''px'' }\n   - DEFAULT_BORDER: Complete border configuration with radius\n   - DEFAULT_SPACING: All four sides with default values\n\n2. Updated property editor cases to use these stable constants:\n   - cssvalue: Uses DEFAULT_CSS_VALUE instead of inline literal\n   - border: Uses DEFAULT_BORDER instead of inline literal\n   - spacing: Uses DEFAULT_SPACING instead of inline literal\n\n**Impact:**\n- Prevents object literal creation on every render\n- Stops infinite onChange → render → onChange loops\n- Eliminates \"Cannot mutate a Store directly\" warnings\n- Resolves \"Maximum call stack exceeded\" errors\n\n**Files Changed:**\n- packages/ui-solid/src/sidebar/PropertyPanel.tsx:\n  - Added 3 stable default constants before component export\n  - Updated 3 switch cases to use stable defaults\n\nTesting: Build passes successfully, no TypeScript errors.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP7K3k6G\nidkyGxAmbXvzPLIoenTacjMzbDQ7ROGwElXA49CZSWlcPWy9dMTSrJit2rYbK5nGJaFT7bHdG2ue\ncww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-17T12:07:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKGMyOTg2MmQxMDk0NTJiODQzNjU4ZTBhMDRjNDE2MTYwODA0YzI0ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/2f87db58d7ecda2b5c6b98d6f939aeea29bd631a","sha":"2f87db58d7ecda2b5c6b98d6f939aeea29bd631a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/2f87db58d7ecda2b5c6b98d6f939aeea29bd631a"}],"sha":"c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/c29862d109452b843658e0a04c416160804c2489"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/2f87db58d7ecda2b5c6b98d6f939aeea29bd631a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T12:01:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T12:01:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: resolve TypeScript errors after merging dev branch\n\nFixed exactOptionalPropertyTypes compliance issues introduced by the merge:\n\n**packages/core/visual-feedback/VisualFeedbackEventBus.ts:**\n- Fixed componentId assignment to handle optional property correctly\n- Conditionally include componentId only when it exists to avoid\n  `string | undefined` vs `string?` type mismatch\n\n**packages/ui-solid/src/mobile/MobileLayoutManager.tsx:**\n- Fixed array destructuring to handle potential undefined\n- Added explicit null check for draggedItem before splice\n- Wrapped optional onClick handlers in Show components\n- Used optional chaining for callback invocations\n\n**packages/ui-solid/src/sidebar/PropertyPanel.tsx:**\n- Fixed Spacing validation to avoid string | number comparison\n- Extracted cssValue to local variable for proper type narrowing\n\nAll packages now build successfully with zero TypeScript errors.","tree":{"sha":"a2efa805978a5b5206ee09e2ae0633a3bf82e5bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/a2efa805978a5b5206ee09e2ae0633a3bf82e5bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/2f87db58d7ecda2b5c6b98d6f939aeea29bd631a","verification":{"payload":"tree a2efa805978a5b5206ee09e2ae0633a3bf82e5bc\nparent 172070b61564785b8bfe7f6a944478edd93fb26e\na