lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/6eeff94db48a360175ef084ac8135a0d5e55a427/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T10:54:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T10:54:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui-solid): complete PHASE 0C - property validation and undo/redo verification\n\n**PHASE 0C: PropertyPanel Integration - COMPLETE**\n\nThis commit marks the completion of PHASE 0C, which integrates all enhanced\nproperty editor components into the PropertyPanel and makes them usable in\nthe email builder.\n\n**What Was Accomplished:**\n\n1. **Property Validation System** (packages/ui-solid/src/sidebar/PropertyPanel.tsx):\n   - Implemented comprehensive validatePropertyValue function\n   - CSSValue validation: type checking, min/max range, valid units\n   - Border validation: width, style whitelist (9 styles), color format\n   - Spacing validation: type checking, non-negative constraint\n   - ImageData validation: URL format, alt text warnings\n   - Console error logging for validation failures\n   - Prevents invalid property updates\n\n2. **Undo/Redo Compatibility Verification**:\n   - Analyzed CommandManager and TemplateUpdateComponentCommand\n   - Confirmed all new types are JSON-serializable (CSSValue, Border, Spacing, ImageData)\n   - Verified deep cloning preserves nested structures correctly\n   - No special handling needed - existing command system works perfectly\n   - Complete template restoration ensures state consistency\n\n3. **Documentation Updates** (docs/planning/TODO.md):\n   - Marked all PHASE 0C tasks as complete\n   - Added comprehensive implementation summary\n   - Updated current status to reflect PHASE 0C completion\n   - Documented property definitions for 10 components\n\n**Previous Commits in PHASE 0C:**\n- e2ce8c0: Initial PropertyPanel integration (types, imports, rendering cases)\n- 0528b2e: Complete property definitions for all components\n\n**Technical Details:**\n- All 5 new property types integrated: cssvalue, border, spacing, displaytoggle, imageupload\n- 10 component property definitions updated with enhanced editors\n- Zero TypeScript errors, zero build errors\n- Full backward compatibility maintained\n\n**Next Phase:**\nPHASE 0D: Documentation & Examples (4-6 hours)","tree":{"sha":"90058436716ed8c0ac80a8b2c342b6b24203c342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/90058436716ed8c0ac80a8b2c342b6b24203c342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/6eeff94db48a360175ef084ac8135a0d5e55a427","verification":{"payload":"tree 90058436716ed8c0ac80a8b2c342b6b24203c342\nparent 0528b2e9c3d03f42848d4f0dbf64a9f5a2aa5dd5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763376896 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763376896 +0000\n\nfeat(ui-solid): complete PHASE 0C - property validation and undo/redo verification\n\n**PHASE 0C: PropertyPanel Integration - COMPLETE**\n\nThis commit marks the completion of PHASE 0C, which integrates all enhanced\nproperty editor components into the PropertyPanel and makes them usable in\nthe email builder.\n\n**What Was Accomplished:**\n\n1. **Property Validation System** (packages/ui-solid/src/sidebar/PropertyPanel.tsx):\n   - Implemented comprehensive validatePropertyValue function\n   - CSSValue validation: type checking, min/max range, valid units\n   - Border validation: width, style whitelist (9 styles), color format\n   - Spacing validation: type checking, non-negative constraint\n   - ImageData validation: URL format, alt text warnings\n   - Console error logging for validation failures\n   - Prevents invalid property updates\n\n2. **Undo/Redo Compatibility Verification**:\n   - Analyzed CommandManager and TemplateUpdateComponentCommand\n   - Confirmed all new types are JSON-serializable (CSSValue, Border, Spacing, ImageData)\n   - Verified deep cloning preserves nested structures correctly\n   - No special handling needed - existing command system works perfectly\n   - Complete template restoration ensures state consistency\n\n3. **Documentation Updates** (docs/planning/TODO.md):\n   - Marked all PHASE 0C tasks as complete\n   - Added comprehensive implementation summary\n   - Updated current status to reflect PHASE 0C completion\n   - Documented property definitions for 10 components\n\n**Previous Commits in PHASE 0C:**\n- e2ce8c0: Initial PropertyPanel integration (types, imports, rendering cases)\n- 0528b2e: Complete property definitions for all components\n\n**Technical Details:**\n- All 5 new property types integrated: cssvalue, border, spacing, displaytoggle, imageupload\n- 10 component property definitions updated with enhanced editors\n- Zero TypeScript errors, zero build errors\n- Full backward compatibility maintained\n\n**Next Phase:**\nPHASE 0D: Documentation & Examples (4-6 hours)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCJ008pd\nrVh9OfwOrcJuGIKwQOCIyJVeUXCOdhhVOP5pXGzOSRub4d/joJjKJzxg8GZ7LAzYmt94Nw2uQCOG\nJQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-17T10:55:12Z"}},