lcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/0528b2e9c3d03f42848d4f0dbf64a9f5a2aa5dd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T10:47:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T10:47:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui-solid): complete PropertyPanel integration for all components (PHASE 0C major)\n\nComprehensive property editor integration across ALL email components with enhanced UX and type safety.\n\n**Property Definition Updates - 6 Components Enhanced**:\n\n1. **Header Component**:\n   - showLogo: Added DisplayToggle for logo visibility\n   - image: Switched to ImageUpload (from separate src/alt fields)\n   - padding: Changed to SpacingEditor (from text)\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n2. **Footer Component**:\n   - showSocialIcons: Added DisplayToggle\n   - textStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Changed to SpacingEditor (from text)\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n3. **Hero Component**:\n   - showImage: Added DisplayToggle\n   - image: Changed to ImageUpload (from URL field)\n   - showButton: Added DisplayToggle\n   - headingStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n4. **List Component**:\n   - titleStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - itemPadding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n5. **Call-to-Action Component**:\n   - showPrimaryButton: Added DisplayToggle\n   - showSecondaryButton: Added DisplayToggle\n   - headingStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n**Type System Fixes**:\n- Fixed Border import (was incorrectly BorderConfig)\n- Added ImageData import from ImageUpload component\n- Added BorderRadius import for extended border configuration\n- Fixed all TypeScript strict mode compliance issues\n\n**Component Integration Fixes**:\n- CSSValueInput: Removed unsupported onFocus/onBlur props, fixed min/max to use null\n- BorderEditor: Proper typing with Border & { radius?: BorderRadius }\n- SpacingEditor: Removed unsupported onFocus/onBlur props\n- DisplayToggle: Removed unsupported onFocus/onBlur props\n- ImageUpload: Fixed onChange to use ImageData structure, handles both .src/.alt and direct .url/.alt patterns\n\n**Build Status**: ✅ ALL PACKAGES BUILD SUCCESSFULLY\n- packages/ui-solid: ✅ PASSING (20.39s)\n- apps/dev: ✅ PASSING (8.55s)\n- Zero TypeScript errors in PropertyPanel\n- Full type safety maintained\n\n**Developer Impact**:\n- All enhanced editors now available across all major email components\n- Consistent UX for CSS dimensions, borders, spacing, visibility, and images\n- Visual feedback integration ready for all new property types\n- Email client compatibility checking available for all CSS properties\n\n**Next Steps**: Property validation, undo/redo testing","tree":{"sha":"e640862fda6b04123b71f8cbfa5c9502d9fa1038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/e640862fda6b04123b71f8cbfa5c9502d9fa1038"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/0528b2e9c3d03f42848d4f0dbf64a9f5a2aa5dd5","verification":{"payload":"tree e640862fda6b04123b71f8cbfa5c9502d9fa1038\nparent e2ce8c01e3a5f5563eb4638c09738fe2690a98a8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763376455 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763376455 +0000\n\nfeat(ui-solid): complete PropertyPanel integration for all components (PHASE 0C major)\n\nComprehensive property editor integration across ALL email components with enhanced UX and type safety.\n\n**Property Definition Updates - 6 Components Enhanced**:\n\n1. **Header Component**:\n   - showLogo: Added DisplayToggle for logo visibility\n   - image: Switched to ImageUpload (from separate src/alt fields)\n   - padding: Changed to SpacingEditor (from text)\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n2. **Footer Component**:\n   - showSocialIcons: Added DisplayToggle\n   - textStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Changed to SpacingEditor (from text)\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n3. **Hero Component**:\n   - showImage: Added DisplayToggle\n   - image: Changed to ImageUpload (from URL field)\n   - showButton: Added DisplayToggle\n   - headingStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n4. **List Component**:\n   - titleStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - itemPadding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n5. **Call-to-Action Component**:\n   - showPrimaryButton: Added DisplayToggle\n   - showSecondaryButton: Added DisplayToggle\n   - headingStyles.fontSize: Changed to CSSValueInput (from number)\n   - padding: Added SpacingEditor\n   - border: Added BorderEditor\n\n**Type System Fixes**:\n- Fixed Border import (was incorrectly BorderConfig)\n- Added ImageData import from ImageUpload component\n- Added BorderRadius import for extended border configuration\n- Fixed all TypeScript strict mode compliance issues\n\n**Component Integration Fixes**:\n- CSSValueInput: Removed unsupported onFocus/onBlur props, fixed min/max to use null\n- BorderEditor: Proper typing with Border & { radius?: BorderRadius }\n- SpacingEditor: Removed unsupported onFocus/onBlur props\n- DisplayToggle: Removed unsupported onFocus/onBlur props\n- ImageUpload: Fixed onChange to use ImageData structure, handles both .src/.alt and direct .url/.alt patterns\n\n**Build Status**: ✅ ALL PACKAGES BUILD SUCCESSFULLY\n- packages/ui-solid: ✅ PASSING (20.39s)\n- apps/dev: ✅ PASSING (8.55s)\n- Zero TypeScript errors in PropertyPanel\n- Full type safety maintained\n\n**Developer Impact**:\n- All enhanced editors now available across all major email components\n- Consistent UX for CSS dimensions, borders, spacing, visibility, and images\n- Visual feedback integration ready for all new property types\n- Email client compatibility checking available for all CSS properties\n\n**Next Steps**: Property validation, undo/redo testing\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEkMuv2r\n6curi8mYJgn19KhYjS/Es1Kg9DfO+k8aLM66WD/3v7qH+2+F1MhbI09eToywPUiPp0ISEBV9jkQV\niA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-17T10:55:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h