or mobile-specific warnings\n\nPhase 10: Validation - Creates validation panel to display mobile-specific\nissues and warnings to help users identify problems with their mobile configurations.\n\nFeatures:\n- Runs DEFAULT_VALIDATION_RULES from core on template\n- Groups issues by severity (Critical, Warning, Info)\n- Shows issue count with collapsible panel\n- Displays rule category, component ID, message, and suggestions\n- Auto-validates when template or device mode changes\n- Only shows when mobile customizations exist or in mobile mode\n\nUI Components:\n- Collapsible panel with warning icon\n- Issue count badge\n- Severity-colored sections (red for critical, yellow for warning, blue for info)\n- Category badges based on rule IDs\n- Component ID display\n- Suggestion hints with 💡 icon\n\nValidation Rules Supported:\n- min-touch-target-size: Check touch target sizes (44px minimum)\n- min-font-size: Check font sizes (14px minimum)\n- overflow-hidden-content: Detect hidden overflow issues\n- all-components-hidden: Warn when all components are hidden\n- excessive-width: Check for components exceeding mobile viewport\n\nComponents:\n- MobileValidationPanel.tsx: Main validation display component\n- MobileValidationPanel.module.scss: Complete styling with severity colors\n- Exported from mobile/index.ts","tree":{"sha":"d670e0cc70916e23ad1b7deca8a81450bbb8ced1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/d670e0cc70916e23ad1b7deca8a81450bbb8ced1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/0122048a1c09217cb3ca1e141b814ac191150362","verification":{"payload":"tree d670e0cc70916e23ad1b7deca8a81450bbb8ced1\nparent 34ebe88a06c1da69c3a0f503d4a9b86788990088\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763376305 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763376305 +0000\n\nfeat(mobile): add MobileValidationPanel for mobile-specific warnings\n\nPhase 10: Validation - Creates validation panel to display mobile-specific\nissues and warnings to help users identify problems with their mobile configurations.\n\nFeatures:\n- Runs DEFAULT_VALIDATION_RULES from core on template\n- Groups issues by severity (Critical, Warning, Info)\n- Shows issue count with collapsible panel\n- Displays rule category, component ID, message, and suggestions\n- Auto-validates when template or device mode changes\n- Only shows when mobile customizations exist or in mobile mode\n\nUI Components:\n- Collapsible panel with warning icon\n- Issue count badge\n- Severity-colored sections (red for critical, yellow for warning, blue for info)\n- Category badges based on rule IDs\n- Component ID display\n- Suggestion hints with 💡 icon\n\nValidation Rules Supported:\n- min-touch-target-size: Check touch target sizes (44px minimum)\n- min-font-size: Check font sizes (14px minimum)\n- overflow-hidden-content: Detect hidden overflow issues\n- all-components-hidden: Warn when all components are hidden\n- excessive-width: Check for components exceeding mobile viewport\n\nComponents:\n- MobileValidationPanel.tsx: Main validation display component\n- MobileValidationPanel.module.scss: Complete styling with severity colors\n- Exported from mobile/index.ts\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMhXYit2\nbWUbEO0rb3xWAGbscRUGfP6dOoBsN6thxnIMWFN1lthYsG+ZWHlAlT6y3G9yitpZrskWCLShEIcN\n/w8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-17T10:45:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github