'spacing'', ''displaytoggle'', ''imageupload''\n- Updated PropertyHoverEvent.propertyType union to include new types\n- Full TypeScript compliance maintained\n\n**Component Imports**:\n- Imported CSSValueInput, BorderEditor, SpacingEditor, DisplayToggle, ImageUpload\n- Imported CSSValue, BorderConfig, Spacing types from @email-builder/core\n\n**Rendering Implementation**:\nAdded 5 new cases in renderPropertyEditor():\n\n1. **CSSValueInput (''cssvalue'')**:\n   - CSS dimension input with unit selector (px, rem, em, etc.)\n   - Integrated with CompatibilityIcon for email client support\n   - Supports min/max constraints and visual feedback events\n\n2. **BorderEditor (''border'')**:\n   - Complete border configuration (width, style, color, radius)\n   - Default values provide sensible 1px solid black border\n   - Hover/focus event integration for visual feedback\n\n3. **SpacingEditor (''spacing'')**:\n   - 4-sided spacing editor for padding/margin\n   - Link/unlink functionality for synchronized editing\n   - Default 0px values for all sides\n\n4. **DisplayToggle (''displaytoggle'')**:\n   - Visual show/hide toggle with eye icon\n   - Boolean value management with safe defaults\n   - Event integration for property tracking\n\n5. **ImageUpload (''imageupload'')**:\n   - Dual-input (file upload + URL)\n   - Manages both src and alt properties\n   - Upload lifecycle event handling\n\n**Property Definition Updates**:\nUpdated component property definitions to use new editors:\n\n- **Button**:\n  - padding: text → spacing\n  - Added border property using ''border'' type\n\n- **Image**:\n  - src/alt: separate fields → imageupload (unified)\n  - width/height: number → cssvalue\n  - Added border property\n\n- **Separator**: height: number → cssvalue\n- **Spacer**: height: number → cssvalue\n\n**Build Status**: ✅ All packages build successfully\n- packages/ui-solid: ✅ PASSING\n- apps/dev: ✅ PASSING\n- Zero TypeScript errors\n- Zero build errors\n\n**Next Steps**:\n- Add more component property definitions\n- Test in dev app\n- Add property validation\n- Verify undo/redo integration","tree":{"sha":"807fcb3752b417f044c4b8f595d46e0be2755bac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/807fcb3752b417f044c4b8f595d46e0be2755bac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/e2ce8c01e3a5f5563eb4638c09738fe2690a98a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 807fcb3752b417f044c4b8f595d46e0be2755bac\nparent a3921e51cb0ff51af4d044e1b5918ffa201029e7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763374485 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763374485 +0000\n\nfeat(ui-solid): integrate enhanced property editors into PropertyPanel (PHASE 0C partial)\n\nIntegrated all 5 new/enhanced molecule components into PropertyPanel with full type safety and rendering support:\n\n**Type System Updates**:\n- Added 5 new PropertyEditorType values: ''cssvalue'', ''border'', ''spacing'', ''displaytoggle'', ''imageupload''\n- Updated PropertyHoverEvent.propertyType union to include new types\n- Full TypeScript compliance maintained\n\n**Component Imports**:\n- Imported CSSValueInput, BorderEditor, SpacingEditor, DisplayToggle, ImageUpload\n- Imported CSSValue, BorderConfig, Spacing types from @email-builder/core\n\n**Rendering Implementation**:\nAdded 5 new cases in renderPropertyEditor():\n\n1. **CSSValueInput (''cssvalue'')**:\n   - CSS dimension input with unit selector (px, rem, em, etc.)\n   - Integrated with CompatibilityIcon for email client support\n   - Supports min/max constraints and visual feedback events\n\n2. **BorderEditor (''border'')**:\n   - Complete border configuration (width, style, color, radius)\n   - Default values provide sensible 1px solid black border\n   - Hover/focus event integration for visual feedback\n\n3. **SpacingEditor (''spacing'')**:\n   - 4-sided spacing editor for padding/margin\n   - Link/unlink functionality for synchronized editing\n   - Default 0px values for all sides\n\n4. **DisplayToggle (''displaytoggle'')**:\n   - Visual show/hide toggle with eye icon\n   - Boolean value management with safe defaults\n   - Event integration for property tracking\n\n5. **ImageUpload (''imageupload'')**:\n   - Dual-input (file upload + URL)\n   - Manages both src and alt properties\n   - Upload lifecycle event handling\n\n**Property Definition Updates**:\nUpdated component property definitions to use new editors:\n\n- **Button**:\n  - padding: text → spacing\n  - Added border property using ''border'' type\n\n- **Image**:\n  - src/alt: separate fields → imageupload (unified)\n  - width/height: number → cssvalue\n  - Added border property\n\n- **Separator**: height: number → cssvalue\n- **Spacer**: height: number → cssvalue\n\n**Build Status**: ✅ All packages build successfully\n- packages/ui-solid: ✅ PASSING\n- apps/dev: ✅ PASSING\n- Zero TypeScript errors\n- Zero build errors\n\n**Next Steps**:\n- Add more component property definitions\n- Test in dev app\n- Add property validation\n- Verify undo/redo integration\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP7jkspr\ngzaxSgAdhvY4GR5YbSURyQOZ56M8b9NWrmdGP4RCckdjCWrAUCQ/DB5csqe9qYhkpwaTdVQsQX57\nOwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-17T10:14:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a