t mobile style overrides\n  * getDesktopValue() - get base desktop value\n  * getMobileValue() - get mobile override value\n- PropertyPanel.module.scss: Add comprehensive mobile styles\n  * .propertyLabelWithMobile - flex container for labels with indicators\n  * .mobileIndicator - 📱 badge for mobile overrides\n  * .resetMobileButton - button to clear mobile overrides\n  * .inheritedValue - display inherited desktop values\n  * .mobileBehaviorSection - section for visibility controls\n  * .visibilityControls - toggle switches for desktop/mobile visibility\n\nNext steps:\n- Update renderPropertyEditor to use mobile indicators\n- Add Mobile Behavior section to panel content\n- Wire up onClearMobileOverride callbacks in Builder","tree":{"sha":"a3eeff3d3c5e61e2c7d56a498375e57981c8399a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/a3eeff3d3c5e61e2c7d56a498375e57981c8399a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/68376cb8823bf86ee57b8ef9593dcf0e7f112086","verification":{"payload":"tree a3eeff3d3c5e61e2c7d56a498375e57981c8399a\nparent 27a531f775b1f3eaf089dbc855823098a2f903ef\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763150910 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763150910 +0000\n\nfeat(mobile): Phase 5 foundation - PropertyPanel mobile infrastructure\n\nAdds foundational infrastructure for mobile development mode in PropertyPanel:\n\nChanges:\n- PropertyPanel.types.ts: Add DeviceMode, onClearMobileOverride, onSetVisibility props\n- PropertyPanel.tsx: Add DeviceMode import and mobile helper functions\n  * isMobileMode() - check if in mobile mode\n  * hasMobileOverride() - detect mobile style overrides\n  * getDesktopValue() - get base desktop value\n  * getMobileValue() - get mobile override value\n- PropertyPanel.module.scss: Add comprehensive mobile styles\n  * .propertyLabelWithMobile - flex container for labels with indicators\n  * .mobileIndicator - 📱 badge for mobile overrides\n  * .resetMobileButton - button to clear mobile overrides\n  * .inheritedValue - display inherited desktop values\n  * .mobileBehaviorSection - section for visibility controls\n  * .visibilityControls - toggle switches for desktop/mobile visibility\n\nNext steps:\n- Update renderPropertyEditor to use mobile indicators\n- Add Mobile Behavior section to panel content\n- Wire up onClearMobileOverride callbacks in Builder\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOIhFEM+\nYaFZ9BVTTyiOLE2P64HhZQQ1XrB8hZNoXZlsBHyvxyZcSBD8r5kkGEBZvwX1o5E/UN+YkKDPC7x/\nXgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-14T20:08:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/68376cb8823bf86ee57b8ef9593dcf0e7f112086","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKDY4Mzc2Y2I4ODIzYmY4NmVlNTdiOGVmOTU5M2RjZjBlN2YxMTIwODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/27a531f775b1f3eaf089dbc8558230