\n\nChanges:\n- TemplateCanvas.tsx: Add deviceMode prop, visibility checks, mobile customization detection\n- TemplateCanvas.module.scss: Add styles for hidden state, badges, fadeIn animations\n- Builder.tsx: Pass deviceMode prop to TemplateCanvas\n- TemplateExporter.ts: Fix type exports and remove unsupported BaseStyles properties\n- core/mobile/index.ts: Fix type exports (use actual exported types)\n- core/src/index.ts: Export utils module for test attributes\n\nTechnical details:\n- Uses createMemo for reactive visibility/customization checks\n- CSS overlay pattern for hidden component visual feedback\n- Proper TypeScript type handling for BaseStyles in TemplateExporter","tree":{"sha":"0287dc8e4a19acb454f163a946183af2021ce1f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/0287dc8e4a19acb454f163a946183af2021ce1f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/27a531f775b1f3eaf089dbc855823098a2f903ef","verification":{"payload":"tree 0287dc8e4a19acb454f163a946183af2021ce1f7\nparent 8a243474a34da634e6dc31dcb0e5852aaf49be8d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763150678 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763150678 +0000\n\nfeat(mobile): complete Phase 6 canvas rendering with mobile visual feedback\n\nAdds comprehensive visual indicators for mobile development mode in the canvas:\n- 📱 badge on components with mobile customizations (desktop mode)\n- 👁️‍🗨️ badge for hidden components\n- Ghosted appearance for hidden components (opacity, grayscale, diagonal stripes)\n- Visual distinction between desktop and mobile modes\n\nChanges:\n- TemplateCanvas.tsx: Add deviceMode prop, visibility checks, mobile customization detection\n- TemplateCanvas.module.scss: Add styles for hidden state, badges, fadeIn animations\n- Builder.tsx: Pass deviceMode prop to TemplateCanvas\n- TemplateExporter.ts: Fix type exports and remove unsupported BaseStyles properties\n- core/mobile/index.ts: Fix type exports (use actual exported types)\n- core/src/index.ts: Export utils module for test attributes\n\nTechnical details:\n- Uses createMemo for reactive visibility/customization checks\n- CSS overlay pattern for hidden component visual feedback\n- Proper TypeScript type handling for BaseStyles in TemplateExporter\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEzNa5/O\nenGJdMq3RH/qTwRrbKhJGmF7kaPx6foZ7Xe0JtCJFXDAWZrFaGxPCwpfn3qahWciHiuYxbL4Gn0V\nqAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-14T20:04:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/27a531f775b1f3eaf089dbc855823098a2f903ef","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKDI3YTUzMWY3NzViMWYzZWFmMDg5ZGJjODU1ODIzMDk4YTJmOTAzZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/8a243474a34da634e6dc31dcb0e5852aaf49be8d","sha":"8a243474a34da634e6dc31dcb0e5852aaf49be8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto