x.ts\n- Created mobile/index.ts barrel export file\n\nStyles:\n- Added .tipsContainer and .modeSwitcherContainer to Builder.module.scss\n- Consistent spacing and borders\n\nBuild Status:\n- packages/core: ✅ PASSING\n- packages/ui-solid: ✅ PASSING (built in ~21s)\n- apps/dev: ✅ PASSING (built in ~9s)\n- Zero TypeScript errors\n\nFeatures Ready:\n✅ Mode switching UI with smooth transitions\n✅ Component reordering via drag-and-drop\n✅ Component visibility controls\n✅ Mobile layout reset functionality\n✅ Keyboard shortcuts (Cmd/Ctrl+M)\n✅ Reactive state management\n✅ Full mobile mode integration\n\nNext: Test in browser at http://localhost:3000/\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOH8C4v8\n6/Ej3GAZCVfPErm4ZGRmujJ1TooIVgC+63XGM4fwz62tZ8AqThlbANO9T9mLBMzdzMG1wsyTwxF0\npAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-14T19:29:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-