"Claude"},"message":"feat(mobile): integrate Mobile Development Mode into core Builder\n\nIntegrated the complete Mobile Development Mode infrastructure into the\n@email-builder/core package and Builder class.\n\nChanges:\n- Exported mobile module from core package (src/index.ts)\n- Integrated ModeManager, PropertyOverrideManager, and MobileLayoutManager into Builder class\n- Added lazy initialization for template-dependent mobile managers\n- Resolved export conflicts (PropertyCategory, ResponsiveStyles, ValidationResult)\n- Added getter methods: getModeManager(), getPropertyOverrideManager(), getMobileLayoutManager()\n- Fixed type conflicts by using selective exports in mobile/index.ts\n\nMobile Infrastructure:\n- DeviceMode enum (DESKTOP/MOBILE)\n- ModeManager for mode switching and state management\n- PropertyOverrideManager for mobile style overrides\n- MobileLayoutManager for component ordering and visibility\n- Component types already support mobileStyles and visibility properties\n- Template type already supports componentOrder per device\n\nBuild Status:\n- packages/core: ✅ PASSING (built in ~6s)\n- Zero TypeScript errors\n- All mobile services compiled successfully\n\nNext Steps:\n- Create UI components in ui-solid (ModeSwitcher, MobileLayoutManager, etc.)\n- Integrate with BuilderContext\n- Update PropertyPanel for mobile indicators\n- Update Canvas rendering for mobile mode","tree":{"sha":"cdc3dbd2f03f32f966521864895e8b3d02cd3c92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/cdc3dbd2f03f32f966521864895e8b3d02cd3c92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/9b641ac1ca0afcf6a319d3b21f6572afda8b4a22","verification":{"payload":"tree cdc3dbd2f03f32f966521864895e8b3d02cd3c92\nparent 3ebe248eaafc4ba588925a8f93b3c3ac36f159ee\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763147951 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763147971 +0000\n\nfeat(mobile): integrate Mobile Development Mode into core Bui