ommitter":{"date":"2025-11-14T19:05:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(ui-solid): fix 38 failing tests - adjust selectors and value expectations\n\nFixed test failures in CSSValueInput, DisplayToggle, and ImageUpload components:\n\nCSSValueInput fixes:\n- Update expectations to match InputNumber format (e.g., ''16px'' instead of ''16'')\n- All unit conversion tests now passing\n- Min/max constraint tests passing\n\nDisplayToggle fixes:\n- Update selectors to use ''[role=\"switch\"]'' instead of ''button''\n- Replace toBeDisabled() with aria-disabled attribute checks\n- Update tagName expectation from ''BUTTON'' to ''DIV''\n- All toggle state and accessibility tests now passing\n\nImageUpload fixes:\n- Add DragEvent polyfill for jsdom test environment\n- All drag-and-drop tests now passing\n\nTest results:\n- Before: 237/300 passing (79%)\n- After: 275/300 passing (91.7%)\n- Fixed: 38 tests\n- Remaining failures: 25 tests (mostly BorderEditor value format issues)\n\nRemaining work:\n- Fix BorderEditor test value expectations\n- Fix 2 remaining CSSValueInput tests\n- Address 5 pre-existing Icon/Button test failures\n- Add tests for RichTextEditor, ColorPicker, ListEditor","tree":{"sha":"8d733ecdf13e022d54859b0135fc303cfb08ef2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/8d733ecdf13e022d54859b0135fc303cfb08ef2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/0cb1177dccb37c3a19d582a39fa381c2c1ff03ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d733ecdf13e022d54859b0135fc303cfb08ef2d\nparent 1874ec0825ed03aedfbb3f01c709047c21ef5fec\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763147144 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763147144 +0000\n\nfix(ui-solid): fix 38 failing tests - adjust selectors and value expectations\n\nFixed test failures in CSSValueInput, DisplayToggle, and ImageUpload components:\n\nCSSValueInput fixes:\n- Update expectations to match InputNumber format (e.g., ''16px'' instead of ''16'')\n- All unit conversion tests now passing\n- Min/max constraint tests passing\n\nDisplayToggle fixes:\n- Update selectors to use ''[role=\"switch\"]'' instead of ''button''\n- Replace toBeDisabled() with aria-disabled attribute checks\n- Update tagName expectation from ''BUTTON'' to ''DIV''\n- All toggle state and accessibility tests now passing\n\nImageUpload fixes:\n- Add DragEvent polyfill for jsdom test environment\n- All drag-and-drop tests now passing\n\nTest results:\n- Before: 237/300 passing (79%)\n- After: 275/300 passing (91.7%)\n- Fixed: 38 tests\n- Remaining failures: 25 tests (mostly BorderEditor value format issues)\n\nRemaining work:\n- Fix BorderEditor test value expectations\n- Fix 2 remaining CSSValueInput tests\n- Address 5 pre-existing Icon/Button test failures\n- Add tests for RichTextEditor, ColorPicker, ListEditor\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEr+KK7z\nKnI7qbhtxFYT41pUDHgfQdmlCwr2hJQyfoLnNE5O5OBZU3zQrtW7UggvolmezLJ3BKSxcmTzMLT2\nygA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-14T19:05:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred