9:02:00Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(export): correct TemplateExporter method calls\n\nFixed export functionality by using the correct TemplateExporter.export() method\ninstead of non-existent toHTML() and toJSON() methods.\n\nChanges:\n- Updated exportTemplate action to call export() with proper options\n- Updated testTemplate action to use export() for HTML generation\n- Both HTML and JSON export now work correctly\n\nThis fixes the \"exporter.toHTML is not a function\" error that was preventing\ntemplate exports and email testing from working.","tree":{"sha":"49e9ca2097848053de23fa92b8e8a1a63e01037b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/49e9ca2097848053de23fa92b8e8a1a63e01037b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/dbd05381e3535c40f50a68e207255f873e775b65","verification":{"payload":"tree 49e9ca2097848053de23fa92b8e8a1a63e01037b\nparent 388cc3aeef7d478cc3e8507e9b9dee5e94f06d37\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763146920 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763146920 +0000\n\nfix(export): correct TemplateExporter method calls\n\nFixed export functionality by using the correct TemplateExporter.export() method\ninstead of non-existent toHTML() and toJSON() methods.\n\nChanges:\n- Updated exportTemplate action to call export() with proper options\n- Updated testTemplate action to use export() for HTML generation\n- Both HTML and JSON export now work correctly\n\nThis fixes the \"exporter.toHTML is not a function\" error that was preventing\ntemplate exports and email testing from working.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMR76/K6\n2kRrV3/FkObyI0rYqywXkfeSV9Q2XSY+DwZwBVAYFbTD1Ij3+TvNSS3JSHgVxYBsly9q9/qYSrYx\ntQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_