":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/1874ec0825ed03aedfbb3f01c709047c21ef5fec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T18:57:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T18:57:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test(ui-solid): add comprehensive unit tests for PHASE 0B components\n\nAdd 237 passing unit tests for 5 new molecule components as part of\nPHASE 0B: Testing & Quality Assurance initiative.\n\nComponents tested:\n- CSSValueInput (40 tests): CSS value editing, unit conversion, constraints\n- DisplayToggle (41 tests): toggle state, icon rendering, accessibility\n- BorderEditor: border width/style/color, radius with link/unlink\n- SpacingEditor: 4-sided spacing, link/unlink behavior, CSSValue handling\n- ImageUpload: file validation, drag-drop, URL input, alt text, object URL cleanup\n\nTest coverage:\n- Unit conversion (px, rem, em, %, pt, auto)\n- Min/max constraints validation\n- Link/unlink functionality for synchronized editing\n- File type and size validation (JPEG, PNG, GIF, SVG, 5MB limit)\n- Drag & drop events\n- onChange callbacks and lifecycle hooks\n- Disabled states\n- Accessibility features (ARIA labels, keyboard navigation)\n- Edge cases and error handling\n\nCurrent status: 237/300 tests passing (79%)\n- 63 minor failures need adjustments (selector updates, value expectations)\n- Tests use vitest with @solidjs/testing-library\n- Follows existing test patterns from Button.test.tsx\n\nRemaining work for PHASE 0B:\n- Fix 63 failing tests (minor adjustments)\n- Add tests for RichTextEditor, ColorPicker, ListEditor\n- Add integration tests (PropertyPanel, template export, responsive)\n- Verify 90%+ test coverage\n\nRelated to Priority 0A roadmap in docs/planning/TODO.md","tree":{"sha":"45ac2b2926500d4013c0b4cb45acac3c43b9180f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/45ac2b2926500d4013c0b4cb45acac3c43b9180f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/1874ec0825ed03aedfbb3f01c709047c21ef5fec","verification":{"payload":"tree 45ac2b2926500d4013c0b4cb45acac3c43b9180f\nparent 2fd19b2815ff0561233f3587dfad38c6098d304b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763146677 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763146677 +0000\n\ntest(ui-solid): add comprehensive unit tests for PHASE 0B components\n\nAdd 237 passing unit tests for 5 new molecule components as part of\nPHASE 0B: Testing & Quality Assurance initiative.\n\nComponents tested:\n- CSSValueInput (40 tests): CSS value editing, unit conversion, constraints\n- DisplayToggle (41 tests): toggle state, icon rendering, accessibility\n- BorderEditor: border width/style/color, radius with link/unlink\n- SpacingEditor: 4-sided spacing, link/unlink behavior, CSSValue handling\n- ImageUpload: file validation, drag-drop, URL input, alt text, object URL cleanup\n\nTest coverage:\n- Unit conversion (px, rem, em, %, pt, auto)\n- Min/max constraints validation\n- Link/unlink functionality for synchronized editing\n- File type and size validation (JPEG, PNG, GIF, SVG, 5MB limit)\n- Drag & drop events\n- onChange callbacks and lifecycle hooks\n- Disabled states\n- Accessibility features (ARIA labels, keyboard navigation)\n- Edge cases and error handling\n\nCurrent status: 237/300 tests passing (79%)\n- 63 minor failures need adjustments (selector updates, value expectations)\n- Tests use vitest 