5ff0561233f3587dfad38c6098d304b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/2fd19b2815ff0561233f3587dfad38c6098d304b"}],"sha":"1874ec0825ed03aedfbb3f01c709047c21ef5fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/1874ec0825ed03aedfbb3f01c709047c21ef5fec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/388cc3aeef7d478cc3e8507e9b9dee5e94f06d37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T17:51:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T17:51:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(compatibility): complete Phase 3 and Phase 4 - Enhanced matrix with filters and CSV export\n\n**Phase 3: Pre-Export Compatibility Checker** (Already Complete ✓)\n- CompatibilityChecker fully integrated in Builder.ts\n- Scans templates for problematic CSS properties\n- Shows detailed warnings before export with severity levels\n- Provides suggested fixes for common compatibility issues\n- CompatibilityReportModal displays comprehensive issue reports\n\n**Phase 4: Email Client Support Matrix** (New Features ✓)\n- Added filtering by platform (desktop/webmail/mobile) and tier (1/2/3)\n- Added sorting by name, tier, or market share\n- Implemented CSV export functionality for documentation\n- Created SupportMatrixModal for easy access to full matrix\n- Integrated modal into Builder with \"View Support Matrix\" button\n- Matrix now shows filtered/sorted clients in both tier sections and feature grid\n\n**Files Modified:**\n- packages/ui-solid/src/compatibility/EmailClientSupportMatrix.tsx\n  - Added createMemo for filtered and sorted clients\n  - Added filter and sort state (platform, tier, sortBy, sortOrder)\n  - Added CSV export function with full property × client matrix\n  - Added filter/sort controls UI\n  - Updated tier sections and matrix table to use filtered clients\n\n- apps/dev/src/components/modals/SupportMatrixModal.tsx\n  - Simplified to use EmailClientSupportMatrix component\n  - Removed complex nested modal logic\n\n- apps/dev/src/components/modals/SupportMatrixModal.module.scss\n  - Simplified SCSS without token dependencies\n  - Fixed build issues with missing token imports\n\n- apps/dev/src/pages/Builder.tsx\n  - Added SupportMatrixModal import and state\n  - Added handleOpenSupportMatrix handler\n  - Wired up onViewSupportMatrix callback in CompatibilityReportModal\n  - Added SupportMatrixModal to JSX\n\n**What This Enables:**\n- Users can filter the matrix to see only relevant email clients\n- Users can sort by different criteria to prioritize testing\n- Users can export support data to CSV for team documentation\n- Users can quickly access the matrix from compatibility reports\n- Comprehensive visibility into CSS property support across all clients\n\nBoth Phase 3 and Phase 4 are now 100% complete!","tree":{"sha":"608918f40d49c33dbbc3f754260089b52e52c278","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/608918f40d49c33dbbc3f754260089b52e52c278"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/388cc3aeef7d478cc3e8507e9b9dee5e94f06d37","verification":{"payload":"tree 608918f40d49c33dbbc3f754260089b52e52c278\nparent 2cea2945e088075a4efcfa366f9c534679b2ce4c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763142693 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763142693 +0000\n\nfeat(compatibility): complete Phase 3 and Phase 4 - Enhanced matrix with filters and CSV export\n\n**Phase 3: Pre-Export Compatibility Checker** (Already Complete ✓)\n- CompatibilityChecker fully integrated in Builder.ts\n- Scans templates for problematic CSS properties\n- Shows detailed warnings before export with severity levels\n- Provides suggested fixes for common compatibility issues\n- CompatibilityReportModal displays comprehensive issue reports\n\n**Phase 4: Email Client Support Matrix** (New Features ✓)\n- Added filtering by platform (desktop/webmail/mobile) and tier (1/2/3)\n- Added sorting by name, tier, or market share\n- Implemented CSV export functionality for documentation\n- Created SupportMatrixModal for easy access to full matrix\n- Integrated modal into Builder with \"View Support Matrix\" button\n- Matrix now shows filtered/sorted clients in both tier sections and feature grid\n\n**Files Modified:**\n- packages/ui-solid/src/compatibility/EmailClientSupportMatrix.tsx\n  - Added createMemo for filtered and sorted clients\n  - Added filter and sort state (platform, tier, sortBy, sortOrder)\n  - Added CSV export function with full property × client matrix\n  - Added filter/sort controls UI\n  - Updated tier sections and matrix table to use filtered clients\n\n- apps/dev/src/components/modals/SupportMatrixModal.tsx\n  - Simplified to use EmailClientSupportMatrix component\n  - Removed complex nested modal logic\n\n- apps/dev/src/components/modals/SupportMatrixModal.module.scss\n  - Simplified SCSS without token dependencies\n  - Fixed build issues with missing token imports\n\n- apps/dev/src/pages/Builder.tsx\n  - Added SupportMatrixModal import and state\n  - Added handleOpenSupportMatrix handler\n  - Wired up onViewSupportMatrix callback in CompatibilityReportModal\n  - Added SupportMatrixModal to JSX\n\n**What This Enables:**\n- Users can filter the matrix to see only relevant email clients\n- Users can sort by different criteria to prioritize testing\n- Users can export support data to CSV for team documentation\n- Users can quickly access the matrix from compatibility reports\n- Comprehensive visibility into CSS property support across all clients\n\nBoth Phase 3 and Phase 4 are now 100% complete!\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKFCEzmN\nvzDMZNJ3nhQ4hAijUHVk3ufhRKGqA1YJxzNXrKI7k/s3CYcv8wn7ZoYHSkCy69Pt1PxEwzlDJcVf\nowE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-14T17:51:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/388cc3aeef7d478c