n- SolidJS reactivity compliance verification\n- Accessibility and type safety notes\n- Code metrics and statistics\n- Integration examples and usage patterns\n- Next steps roadmap\n- Review checklist\n\nTotal documentation: ~500 lines covering 3,200+ lines of code.\nReady for PR submission to main/dev branch.","tree":{"sha":"40eb2b3d267c08eedf85c9c68594d8a87f0e50fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/40eb2b3d267c08eedf85c9c68594d8a87f0e50fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/6d1adbfcec32ffbd8a735dd3991b63a7c8ba868b","verification":{"payload":"tree 40eb2b3d267c08eedf85c9c68594d8a87f0e50fd\nparent 308244b823eb4f0e2504938cc82eee7e5f9dbc72\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762954625 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762954625 +0000\n\ndocs: add comprehensive PR description for PHASE 0A\n\nAdd detailed PR description documenting all work completed in\nPHASE 0A: Common Systems Foundation.\n\nIncludes:\n- Complete overview of 8 components (5 new, 3 enhanced)\n- Detailed feature descriptions with code examples\n- Architecture and design decisions\n- SolidJS reactivity compliance verification\n- Accessibility and type safety notes\n- Code metrics and statistics\n- Integration examples and usage patterns\n- Next steps roadmap\n- Review checklist\n\nTotal documentation: ~500 lines covering 3,200+ lines of code.\nReady for PR submission to main/dev branch.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMhwM/kM\n3nlNEyym9twzjU348n1FWTrnH4ZwzW4B6hnlYs/eqIMCehEiUlLLyLovdX70FYMLsyu0fObz7lT8\n6wk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T13:37:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy