66a4a2a544e7fd65d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T13:34:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T13:34:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: update SOLID_REACTIVITY_GUIDE.md with createEffect self-triggering pattern\n\nAdded comprehensive documentation for the second root cause:\n- New section: \"createEffect Self-Triggering (CRITICAL!)\"\n- Real-world example from AccessibilityAnnouncer.tsx showing the debounceTimer fix\n- Common mistake #4: createEffect reading and writing same signal\n- New checklist for createEffect\n- Updated questions section with createEffect scenario\n\nThis documents the most dangerous and common pattern: effects that read\nand write the same signal, causing infinite self-triggering loops.","tree":{"sha":"f29e56850a1557206862836d01f69fdf2cac24de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/f29e56850a1557206862836d01f69fdf2cac24de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/f9dc6a11dfaa2fe938a2b8066a4a2a544e7fd65d","verification":{"payload":"tree f29e56850a1557206862836d01f69fdf2cac24de\nparent cdd90693aa00e0cb91d5c9f0ac4d954ab0030062\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762954442 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762954442 +0000\n\ndocs: update SOLID_REACTIVITY_GUIDE.md with createEffect self-triggering pattern\n\nAdded comprehensive documentation for the second root cause:\n- New section: \"createEffect Self-Triggering (CRITICAL!)\"\n- Real-world example from AccessibilityAnnouncer.tsx showing the debounceTimer fix\n- Common mistake #4: createEffect reading and writing same signal\n- New checklist for createEffect\n- Updated questions section with createEffect scenario\n\nThis documents the most dangerous and common pattern: effects that read\nand write the same signal, causing infinite self-triggering loops.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHY0Ilqk\neSsZI8QJdgSAya6DbOtYk9mL5UZzmnjcK7dpANbFr4MbeGnyU6Of7q9Egm7YiayGbJ/2roIvkNFB\ntA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T13:34:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/f9dc6a11dfaa2fe938a2b8066a4a2a544e7fd65d","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKGY5ZGM2YTExZGZhYTJmZTkzOGEyYjgwNjZhNGEyYTU0NGU3ZmQ2NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/cdd90693aa00e0cb91d5c9f0ac4d954ab0030062","sha":"cdd90693aa00e0cb91d5c9f0ac4d954ab0030062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/cdd90693aa00e0cb91d5c9f0ac4d954ab0030062"}],"sha":"f9dc6a11dfaa2fe938a2b8066a4a2a544e7fd65d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/f9dc6a11dfaa2fe938a2b8066a4a2a544e7fd65d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/cdd90693aa00e0cb91d5c9f0ac4d954ab0030062/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T13:18:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T13:18:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: untrack debounceTimer read in createEffect to prevent self-triggering loop\n\nThe createEffect was reading debounceTimer() which created a reactive\ndependency, then writing to it with setDebounceTimer(), causing the\neffect to trigger itself infinitely:\n\ncreateEffect runs → reads debounceTimer() → sets debounceTimer() →\ncreateEffect runs again → ... → stack overflow\n\nThe fix uses untrack() when reading the timer to prevent the reactive\ndependency while still allowing the effect to track isEditing and\ncurrentProperty changes.","tree":{"sha":"2b848eb973a3a8b0cce413459f0c53939ccb9b1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/2b848eb973a3a8b0cce413459f0c53939ccb9b1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/cdd90693aa00e0cb91d5c9f0ac4d954ab0030062","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b848eb973a3a8b0cce413459f0c53939ccb9b1b\nparent ced4cc5aef23f99823e036a53b1a0958aa52e72a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762953487 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762953487 +0000\n\nfix: untrack debounceTimer read in createEffect to prevent self-triggering loop\n\nThe createEffect was reading debounceTimer() which created a reactive\ndependency, then writing to it with setDebounceTimer(), causing the\neffect to trigger itself infinitely:\n\ncreateEffect runs → reads debounceTimer() → sets debounceTimer() →\ncreateEffect runs again → ... → stack overflow\n\nThe fix uses untrack() when reading the timer to prevent the reactive\ndependency while still allowing the effect to track isEditing and\ncurrentProperty changes.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBf5GvT9\nyqi7sl6EwHVU6ENFlVE5S7NEJ6AR6gDhe3+5z7aqzLyv45L+O6Yocp9jPLxoTyBaer3juAblxYHP\nbQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T13:18:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"Use