ffect import from SpacingEditor\n\nRemove unused createEffect and createSignal imports from SpacingEditor\nto align with SOLID_REACTIVITY_GUIDE.md best practices. Component only\nuses DOM event handlers which are safe and don''t require untrack().\n\n- Removed unused imports: createEffect, createSignal\n- No functional changes\n- Prevents confusion about reactivity patterns\n- Aligns with guide: DOM event handlers are safe without untrack()","tree":{"sha":"eacb218efc04db7f4243b7d00520f61915f5fbb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/eacb218efc04db7f4243b7d00520f61915f5fbb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/47c3e867c61fbca818a667636085c394f6fb2a2a","verification":{"payload":"tree eacb218efc04db7f4243b7d00520f61915f5fbb4\nparent d7b40c690ca096dda3bfddc06396e675ff72e28a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952924 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952924 +0000\n\nfix(ui): remove unused createEffect import from SpacingEditor\n\nRemove unused createEffect and createSignal imports from SpacingEditor\nto align with SOLID_REACTIVITY_GUIDE.md best practices. Component only\nuses DOM event handlers which are safe and don''t require untrack().\n\n- Removed unused imports: createEffect, createSignal\n- No functional changes\n- Prevents confusion about reactivity patterns\n- Aligns with guide: DOM event handlers are safe without untrack()\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK3SjENq\n2eTDnsJV7WWiZ0QfYPZbA89YNm3icpBfzUrm8l+U00lkCcak7qvoX4arqKy/eej4PltIMwLDq7FU\nFQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T13:08:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url"