IVITY_GUIDE.md with:\n- Detailed explanation of the untrack() pattern\n- Examples of correct and incorrect usage\n- Real-world examples from this codebase\n- Testing guidelines\n- Common mistakes to avoid\n- Quick reference checklist\n\nAlso added warning comments in key files:\n- PropertyPanel.tsx - guide for anyone working on property panel\n- AccessibilityAnnouncer.tsx - reminder about critical untrack() usage\n- BuilderContext.tsx - reminder about event handler patterns\n- README.md - prominent link to the guide\n\nThis ensures other developers and AI agents understand the critical\npattern needed to prevent stack overflow errors when working with\nSolid.js signals in event handlers.","tree":{"sha":"4485bf8035379459199338e66177b3f00ef65f59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/4485bf8035379459199338e66177b3f00ef65f59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/ced4cc5aef23f99823e036a53b1a0958aa52e72a","verification":{"payload":"tree 4485bf8035379459199338e66177b3f00ef65f59\nparent 779b3f8d058dba9b7faa5398c58e0c911cbfc7c9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952415 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952415 +0000\n\ndocs: add comprehensive Solid.js reactivity guide for developers/agents\n\nAdded SOLID_REACTIVITY_GUIDE.md with:\n- Detailed explanation of the untrack() pattern\n- Examples of correct and incorrect usage\n- Real-world examples from this codebase\n- Testing guidelines\n- Common mistakes to avoid\n- Quick reference checklist\n\nAlso added warning comments in key files:\n- PropertyPanel.tsx - guide for anyone working on property panel\n- AccessibilityAnnouncer.tsx - reminder about critical untrack() usage\n- BuilderContext.tsx - reminder about event handler patterns\n- README.md - prominent link to the guide\n\nThis ensures other developers and AI agents understand the critical\npattern needed to prevent stack overflow errors when working with\nSolid.js signals in event handlers.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFGIdBjd\naO64L4FcbdD+9pgPv/NHUpJPf7R9Ss3yCMzRJGHXiTWdZ9PnOQEgOQfnXOKQ8siJlA5WXvYzHIxi\nCQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T13:00:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/ced4cc5aef23f99823e036a53b1a0958aa52e72a","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKGNlZDRjYzVhZWYyM2Y5OTgyM2UwMzZhNTNiMWEwOTU4YWE1MmU3MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/779b3f8d058dba9b7faa5398c58e0c911cbfc7c9","sha":"779b3f8d058dba9b7faa5398c58e0c911cbfc7c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/779b3f8d058dba9b7faa5398c58e0c911cbfc7c9"}],"sha":"ced4cc5aef23f99823e036a53b1a0958aa52e72a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/ced4cc5aef23f99823e036a53b1a0958aa52e72a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/780dc684cb6defa60a10af3c5df10c9563d2e161/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:57:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:57:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui): add ListEditor component with drag-and-drop reordering\n\nAdd comprehensive list/array editor component:\n- Add and remove items dynamically\n- Drag-and-drop reordering with visual feedback\n- Custom item rendering via renderItem prop\n- Min/max item constraints\n- Configurable add/remove/reorder permissions\n- Drag handle with hover states\n- Empty state with icon\n- Disabled state support\n\nFeatures implemented:\n✓ Dynamic add/remove with constraints (minItems, maxItems)\n✓ Drag-and-drop reordering with native HTML5 drag API\n✓ Visual feedback for dragging and drag-over states\n✓ Customizable item rendering via renderItem function\n✓ createNewItem factory function for custom item creation\n✓ Full event callbacks (onChange, onAdd, onRemove, onReorder)\n✓ Accessibility with ARIA labels and keyboard support\n✓ Comprehensive SCSS with transitions and hover effects\n\nThis component is essential for editing arrays of data like:\n- Social media links lists\n- Navigation menu items\n- Button action lists\n- Image galleries\n- Any dynamic list of custom items\n\nCompletes PHASE 0A - Common Systems foundation for\nenhanced email component property editors.","tree":{"sha":"3674551c3153789d730118560929bf270607aac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/3674551c3153789d730118560929bf270607aac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/780dc684cb6defa60a10af3c5df10c9563d2e161","verification":{"payload":"tree 3674551c3153789d730118560929bf270607aac3\nparent 33d0df1c887c595d66e36a46d33b1be644432345\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952221 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952221 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): add ListEditor component with drag-and-drop reordering\n\nAdd comprehensive list/array editor component:\n- Add and remove items dynamically\n- Drag-and-drop reordering with visual feedback\n- Custom item rendering via renderItem prop\n- Min/max item constraints\n- Configurable add/remove/reorder permissions\n- Drag handle with hover states\n- Empty state with icon\n- Disabled state support\n\nFeatures implemented:\n✓ Dynamic add/remove with constraints (minItems, maxItems)\n✓ Drag-and-drop reordering with native HTML5 drag API\n✓ Visual feedback for dragging and drag-over states\n✓ Customizable item rendering via renderItem function\n✓ createNewItem factory function for custom item creation\n✓ Full event callbacks (onChange, onAdd, onRemove, onReorder)\n✓ Accessibility with ARIA labels and keyboard support\n✓ Comprehensive SCSS with transitions and hover effects\n\nThis component is essential for editing arrays of data like:\n- Social media links lists\n- Navigation menu items\n- Button action lists\n- Image galleries\n- Any dynamic list of custom it