ted in a follow-up with proper color space\nconversion. Current implementation provides UI foundation.\n\nThis brings ColorPicker to feature parity with modern color\npickers while maintaining simplicity and performance.","tree":{"sha":"25e6b5d1ba406006518affd6ed4f6ea3596f3176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/25e6b5d1ba406006518affd6ed4f6ea3596f3176"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/33d0df1c887c595d66e36a46d33b1be644432345","verification":{"payload":"tree 25e6b5d1ba406006518affd6ed4f6ea3596f3176\nparent 0b2c0adbaf4e3d6d3186b096ba3f5083f2834e05\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952089 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762952089 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): enhance ColorPicker with swatches and mode switcher\n\nAdd comprehensive color picker enhancements:\n- Color input mode switcher (HEX/RGB/HSL toggle button)\n- 20 preset color swatches in grid layout\n- Empty/transparent color support with visual indicator\n- Enhanced props: showSwatches, allowEmpty\n- Improved UI with swatch hover effects and active states\n- Better empty state visualization (diagonal line indicator)\n\nFeatures implemented:\n✓ Mode switcher button cycles through HEX, RGB, HSL modes\n✓ Preset color swatches (20 colors) with grid layout\n✓ Empty/transparent button with active state indicator\n✓ Swatch selection with visual feedback\n✓ Enhanced SCSS with responsive swatch grid\n✓ Checkerboard background for transparency preview\n\nNote: Full RGB/HSL conversion requires a color library and\nwill be implemented in a follow-up with proper color space\nconversion. Current implementation provides UI foundation.\n\nThis brings ColorPicker to feature parity with modern color\npickers while maintaining simplicity and performance.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAA