ttps://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/e944f093c56888305c357d30c1e5efb952cc569b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:14:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:14:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(core): add feature parity type system foundations\n\nPHASE 0A - Common Systems foundations:\n\n1. Expanded CSSUnit type to include ''pt'' (required for feature parity)\n2. Created BorderStyle type with all 9 CSS border styles:\n   - Added: groove, ridge, inset, outset\n   - Note: Limited Outlook support for 3D styles\n3. Updated Border interface to use BorderStyle type\n4. Created CSSValueInput component:\n   - Wraps InputNumber for editing CSSValue objects\n   - Supports all CSS units (px, rem, em, %, pt, auto)\n   - Provides input + unit dropdown interface\n   - Foundation for all measurement inputs (margins, padding, spacing, sizes)\n   - Located: packages/ui-solid/src/molecules/CSSValueInput/\n5. Exported CSSValueInput from molecules index\n\nDependencies ready for:\n- Border Editor (uses CSSValueInput + BorderStyle)\n- Spacing Editor (uses CSSValueInput)\n- All property editors requiring CSS measurements\n\nRef: REQUIREMENTS.md Section 20.2.1 (Border System), 20.2.6 (Unit System)","tree":{"sha":"8ecc61869214a0357515b6803b811b4c3ffd9942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/8ecc61869214a0357515b6803b811b4c3ffd9942"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/e944f093c56888305c357d30c1e5efb952cc569b","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ecc61869214a0357515b6803b811b4c3ffd9942\nparent 1d96a2f19418d0104eb8de43322fa9a5a936ee97\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762949648 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762949648 +0000\n\nfeat(core): add feature parity type system foundations\n\nPHASE 0A - Common Systems foundations:\n\n1. Expanded CSSUnit type to include ''pt'' (required for feature parity)\n2. Created BorderStyle type with all 9 CSS border styles:\n   - Added: groove, ridge, inset, outset\n   - Note: Limited Outlook support for 3D styles\n3. Updated Border interface to use BorderStyle type\n4. Created CSSValueInput component:\n   - Wraps InputNumber for editing CSSValue objects\n   - Supports all CSS units (px, rem, em, %, pt, auto)\n   - Provides input + unit dropdown interface\n   - Foundation for all measurement inputs (margins, padding, spacing, sizes)\n   - Located: packages/ui-solid/src/molecules/CSSValueInput/\n5. Exported CSSValueInput from molecules index\n\nDependencies ready for:\n- Border Editor (uses CSSValueInput + BorderStyle)\n- Spacing Editor (uses CSSValueInput)\n- All property editors requiring CSS measurements\n\nRef: REQUIREMENTS.md Section 20.2.1 (Border System), 20.2.6 (Unit System)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOpWYRQD\n0bEhC5ssKvLeB/tN72+l3eRh/ePArZLLI9lBvCPkLXfrDIjEQyfKYe4sDLB5TkljyFjltVwVHAcX\nLww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T12:14:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_ur