,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:10:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test: add integration test to verify stack overflow prevention\n\nAdded comprehensive integration test that simulates the actual stack\noverflow scenario:\n- PropertyPanel emitting property:edit:start on focus\n- Handler attempting recursive emissions\n- Verifies debouncing prevents infinite loops\n\nTest results prove the fix works:\n- Emit attempts: 2, Handler calls: 1 (recursive emit was debounced)\n- Performance test: 102ms, 1 call (no infinite loop)\n- All 4 integration tests pass\n\nThis test validates that the debouncing solution prevents the\n''Maximum call stack size exceeded'' error.","tree":{"sha":"2351dd6a7dda16aee0e3bdd9a9b7d26d30769b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/2351dd6a7dda16aee0e3bdd9a9b7d26d30769b18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/c6c9c80c1e9bdc150df13818db471c57ea9b799f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/c6c9c80c1e9bdc150df13818db471c57ea9b799f","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKGM2YzljODBjMWU5YmRjMTUwZGYxMzgxOGRiNDcxYzU3ZWE5Yjc5OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b","sha":"024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b"}],"sha":"c6c9c80c1e9bdc150df13818db471c57ea9b799f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/c6c9c80c1e9bdc150df13818db471c57ea9b799f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/1d96a2f19418d0104eb8de43322fa9a5a936ee97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:04:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:04:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: add comprehensive component customization and new component requirements\n\nComplete feature parity documentation for existing email builder with 9 components:\n- Header, Footer, Hero, Call to Action, Duo Panel, Spaced Text, List, Links List, Code\n\nSection 20: Existing Feature Parity Requirements (860+ lines):\n- Common features & patterns (border, margin, spacing, rich text editor, color picker, etc.)\n- Complete property definitions for all 9 existing components\n- All Style Tab and Content Tab properties documented\n- UI/UX requirements specified\n- Feature parity summary with implementation priorities\n\nCritical features documented:\n- Fit to container vs With margins toggle\n- Linked inputs for margins/padding\n- Per-corner border radius controls (toggleable sections)\n- Force Outlook border-radius for buttons with custom width\n- Per-element margins within list items (title, description, button, image)\n- Image/Content ratio slider (0-100%)\n- Button height control (auto or custom)\n- Button text alignment within button\n- Rich text editor: full formatting toolbar, code blocks, subscript/superscript, background color, line height\n- Vertical and horizontal spacing controls\n- Wrap list options for mobile\n- Margin colors for visual debugging\n- Table layout options for Spaced Text\n- Social network icon size and wrapping\n- Navigation bar width or spacing toggle\n- All 9 border styles supported\n- Web fonts marked with asterisk\n\nNew components documented that don''t exist yet:\n- Duo Panel (side-by-side comparison)\n- Spaced Text (left-right justified text)\n- Links List (standalone links component)\n- Code (custom HTML/CSS injection)\n\nAll Phase 1 requirements now split:\n- PHASE 0: Feature Parity (Section 20) - must implement first\n- PHASE 1: Email Critical Enhancements (Sections 18-19) - after parity","tree":{"sha":"272731787e391fe4eaa756a68db1e4cd05b5ace1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/272731787e391fe4eaa756a68db1e4cd05b5ace1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/1d96a2f19418d0104eb8de43322fa9a5a936ee97","verification":{"payload":"tree 272731787e391fe4eaa756a68db1e4cd05b5ace1\nparent e1a4331a91828e9e26f1fa51b0e4a2f52a318654\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762949089 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762949089 +0000\n\ndocs: add comprehensive component customization and new component requirements\n\nComplete feature parity documentation for existing email builder with 9 components:\n- Header, Footer, Hero, Call to Action, Duo Panel, Spaced Text, List, Links List, Code\n\nSection 20: Existing Feature Parity Requirements (860+ lines):\n- Common features & patterns (border, margin, spacing, rich text editor, color picker, etc.)\n- Complete property definitions for all 9 existing components\n- All Style Tab and Content Tab properties documented\n- UI/UX requirements specified\n- Feature parity summary with implementation priorities\n\nCritical features documented:\n- Fit to container vs With margins toggle\n- Linked inputs for margins/padding\n- Per-corner border radius controls (toggleable sections)\n- Force Outlook border-radius for buttons with custom width\n- Per-element margins within list items (title, description, button, image)\n- Image/Content ratio slider (0-100%)\n- Button height control (auto or custom)\n- Button text alignment within button\n- Rich text editor: full formatting toolbar, code blocks, subscript/superscript, background color, line height\n- Vertical and horizontal spacing controls\n- Wrap list options for mobile\n- Margin colors for visual debugging\n- Table layout options for Spaced Text\n- Social network icon size and wrapping\n- Navigation bar width or spacing toggle\n- All 9 border styles supported\n- Web fonts marked with asterisk\n\nNew components documented that don''t exist yet:\n- Duo Panel (side-by-side comparison)\n- Spaced Text (left-right justified text)\n- Links List (standalone links component)\n- Code (custom HTML/CSS injection)\n\nAll Phase 1 requirements now split:\n- PHASE 0: Feature Parity (Section 20) - must implement first\n- PHASE 1: Email Critical Enhancements (Sections 18-19) - after parity\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKyjueun\nuyBQcO8gvC3uSsOxCbX5vl7b/tD7a1/+NuzXnrd0JDQaNhfHndRrohgipmsi2ARcEDWovUwClmxQ\nNAI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T12:05:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/1d96a2f19418d0104eb8de43322fa9a5a936ee97","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKDFkOTZhMmYxOTQxOGQwMTA0ZWI4ZGU0MzMyMmZhOWE1YTkzNmVlOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/e1a4331a91828e9e26f1fa51b0e4a2f52a318654","sha":"e1a4331a91828e9e26f1fa51b0e4a2f52a318654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/e1a4331a91828e9e26f1fa51b0e4a2f52a318654"}],"sha":"1d96a2f19418d0104eb8de43322fa9a5a936ee97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/1d96a2f19418d0104eb8de43322fa9a5a936ee97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:01:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T12:01:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: add debouncing to VisualFeedbackEventBus to prevent infinite event loops\n\nThe setTimeout fix wasn''t sufficient - event handlers were updating Solid\nsignals which triggered re-renders, which re-emitted the same events,\ncreating an infinite loop that still caused stack overflow.\n\nThe root cause:\n1. PropertyPanel emits property:edit:start on focus\n2. Handler updates signals in VisualFeedbackManager\n3. Signal updates trigger Solid reactive updates\n4. Reactive updates somehow re-trigger focus event\n5. Goes back to step 1 = infinite loop\n\nSolution - Event Debouncing:\n- Track last emitted event (type + propertyPath + componentId + timestamp)\n- Ignore duplicate events within 50ms debounce window\n- This breaks the infinite loop while still allowing legitimate rapid events\n\nChanges:\n- Added lastEmittedEvent tracking to VisualFeedbackEventBus\n- Added 50ms debounce check in emit() method\n- Debouncing considers type, propertyPath, and componentId\n- Updated test to expect debounced behavior (1 call instead of 3)\n- clear() method now resets lastEmittedEvent\n\nTests: 806/808 passing (2 unrelated failures)","tree":{"sha":"daa7fb01e97de858e4b518ff36a5dbb6407f63fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/daa7fb01e97de858e4b518ff36a5dbb6407f63fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKDAyNGY0YWUyMGU5NmU3ZWVlNzQxMDFkNWYwODkxODg2NWRlMGU5OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455","sha":"b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455"}],"sha":"024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/024f4ae20e96e7eee74101d5f08918865de0e99b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:43:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:43:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: use setTimeout instead of queueMicrotask to prevent stack overflow\n\nThe previous fix using queueMicrotask wasn''t sufficient - it still allowed\nSolid.js reactive updates to recurse within the same task. This caused\n\"Maximum call stack size exceeded\" errors in the browser.\n\nChanges:\n- Changed EventEmitter.emit() from queueMicrotask to setTimeout(, 0)\n- Changed VisualFeedbackEventBus.emit() from queueMicrotask to setTimeout(, 0)\n- setTimeout schedules callbacks in a completely new task, not just a microtask\n- This fully breaks out of Solid.js''s reactive batching cycle\n\nUpdated all tests to use:\n- const waitForEmit = () => new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 10))\n- Replaced all queueMicrotask waits with setTimeout waits\n- Updated 12 test files with proper async waiting\n\nWhy setTimeout works:\n- queueMicrotask runs in the same task (still within Solid''s reactive batch)\n- setTimeout creates a new task on the event loop\n- New task = completely fresh call stack = no recursion possible\n\nTests: 807/808 passing (1 unrelated failure about error message wording)","tree":{"sha":"807d9ace2c5953fba2ddc33066dbb710fb8f8c6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/807d9ace2c5953fba2ddc33066dbb710fb8f8c6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKGI2MzEzODUyNmM3ZTY1NGNmYzJkZjc3ZThiYzVhZjA0NWZmN2U0NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/e4db6bf288c8162ebead754a3f330706149aa194","sha":"e4db6bf288c8162ebead754a3f330706149aa194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/e4db6bf288c8162ebead754a3f330706149aa194"}],"sha":"b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/b63138526c7e654cfc2df77e8bc5af045ff7e455"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/e1a4331a91828e9e26f1fa51b0e4a2f52a318654/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:43:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:43:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: restructure priorities for email-first development strategy\n\nEmail components are immediate priority for production. Web builder features deferred to Q3 2026.\n\nKey changes:\n- Added Email-First Prioritization section (18.1.1) with clear framework\n- Updated Implementation Priority Matrix (18.4) with email compatibility column\n- Reorganized new component priorities based on email support\n- Moved CTA to Phase 1 (email-critical)\n- Moved Table to Phase 1 (excellent email support, transactional emails)\n- Moved Progress Bar to Phase 2 (good email support)\n- Moved Video to Phase 3 (limited email support, poster fallback only)\n- Updated cross-component property priorities for email compatibility\n- Added email use cases column to component priority summary (19.5)\n- Created email-first implementation notes (19.6)\n\nPhase 1 (Email Critical): Per-side spacing/borders, Button/Image/Header/Footer/Hero/CTA enhancements, Product/Countdown/Table components\nPhase 2 (Email Important): Typography, List/Text/Separator/Spacer enhancements, Social Proof/Icon List/Columns/Divider/Progress Bar\nPhase 3 (Web-Focused, Q3 2026): Shadows, gradients, filters, Video/Accordion/Form components, carousel/parallax effects\n\nAll priorities now driven by Outlook 2016+ compatibility.","tree":{"sha":"9b7ee4a3801bc00a5c1d335c9082cb83037057b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/9b7ee4a3801bc00a5c1d335c9082cb83037057b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/e1a4331a91828e9e26f1fa51b0e4a2f52a318654","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b7ee4a3801bc00a5c1d335c9082cb83037057b4\nparent 8fe433e646ffb0cbe343eeff9c7c319f1acab93b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762947806 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762947806 +0000\n\ndocs: restructure priorities for email-first development strategy\n\nEmail components are immediate priority for production. Web builder features deferred to Q3 2026.\n\nKey changes:\n- Added Email-First Prioritization section (18.1.1) with clear framework\n- Updated Implementation Priority Matrix (18.4) with email compatibility column\n- Reorganized new component priorities based on email support\n- Moved CTA to Phase 1 (email-critical)\n- Moved Table to Phase 1 (excellent email support, transactional emails)\n- Moved Progress Bar to Phase 2 (good email support)\n- Moved Video to Phase 3 (limited email support, poster fallback only)\n- Updated cross-component property priorities for email compatibility\n- Added email use cases column to component priority summary (19.5)\n- Created email-first implementation notes (19.6)\n\nPhase 1 (Email Critical): Per-side spacing/borders, Button/Image/Header/Footer/Hero/CTA enhancements, Product/Countdown/Table components\nPhase 2 (Email Important): Typography, List/Text/Separator/Spacer enhancements, Social Proof/Icon List/Columns/Divider/Progress Bar\nPhase 3 (Web-Focused, Q3 2026): Shadows, gradients, filters, Video/Accordion/Form components, carousel/parallax effects\n\nAll priorities now driven by Outlook 2016+ compatibility.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJmW9qSa\nrfJ7E6IKu2Ap6ny3KRGwhhJNP1KI/LtRQacWSIPuQy2VmumR2E0S+gdEKEHVSD55uvr+iGbVyYYG\nQgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T11:43:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com