aneto/email-builder/commits/8fe433e646ffb0cbe343eeff9c7c319f1acab93b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:36:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:36:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: add comprehensive component customization and new component requirements\n\nResearch-based enhancements inspired by Elastic Email, Mailchimp, SalesManago, and other leading email builders:\n\nSection 18 - Enhanced Component Customization Properties:\n- Cross-component enhancements (spacing, borders, typography, colors, shadows, sizing)\n- Component-specific enhancements for all 10 existing components\n- Detailed email compatibility notes and priority ratings\n- Implementation priority matrix for phased rollout\n\nSection 19 - New Out-of-the-Box Components:\n- Priority 1: Video, Countdown Timer, Product components\n- Priority 2: Social Proof, Icon List, Columns, Table, Divider\n- Priority 3: Progress Bar, Accordion, Form components\n- Complete property definitions and use cases\n\nKey priorities:\n- HIGH: Per-side spacing/borders, Button/Image/Header/Footer/Hero enhancements\n- MEDIUM: Advanced typography, List/CTA enhancements, new essential components\n- LOW: Shadow effects, specialized components\n\n3-phase implementation plan defined with clear priorities.","tree":{"sha":"dc291921d2871f21f7358601998dc020ef02550b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/dc291921d2871f21f7358601998dc020ef02550b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/8fe433e646ffb0cbe343eeff9c7c319f1acab93b","verification":{"payload":"tree dc291921d2871f21f7358601998dc020ef02550b\nparent 5d1aa517e741dbe6e8efa5333ca792518e2259a6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762947387 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762947387 +0000\n\ndocs: add comprehensive component customization and new component requirements\n\nResearch-based enhancements inspired by Elastic Email, Mailchimp, SalesManago, and other leading email builders:\n\nSection 18 - Enhanced Component Customization Properties:\n- Cross-component enhancements (spacing, borders, typography, colors, shadows, sizing)\n- Component-specific enhancements for all 10 existing components\n- Detailed email compatibility notes and priority ratings\n- Implementation priority matrix for phased rollout\n\nSection 19 - New Out-of-the-Box Components:\n- Priority 1: Video, Countdown Timer, Product components\n- Priority 2: Social Proof, Icon List, Columns, Table, Divider\n- Priority 3: Progress Bar, Accordion, Form components\n- Complete property definitions and use cases\n\nKey priorities:\n- HIGH: Per-side spacing/borders, Button/Image/Header/Footer/Hero enhancements\n- MEDIUM: Advanced typography, List/CTA enhancements, new essential components\n- LOW: Shadow effects, specialized components\n\n3-phase implementation plan defined with clear priorities.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHBmzg5W\nbdorNnIczysmOtHUQwXxPGC2A/c1jtuY+dZka/bMlaAwcGwc8WkXSSei+RmhgxcwRx8XK0OY5d7x\nOQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T11:36:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/8fe433e646ffb0cbe343eeff9c7c319f1acab93b","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKDhmZTQzM2U2NDZmZmIwY2JlMzQzZWVmZjljN2MzMTlmMWFjYWI5M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/5d1aa517e741dbe6e8efa5333ca792518e2259a6","sha":"5d1aa517e741dbe6e8efa5333ca792518e2259a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/5d1aa517e741dbe6e8efa5333ca792518e2259a6"}],"sha":"8fe433e646ffb0cbe343eeff9c7c319f1acab93b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/8fe433e646ffb0cbe343eeff9c7c319f1acab93b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/e4db6bf288c8162ebead754a3f330706149aa194/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:11:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T11:11:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: prevent stack overflow by making EventEmitter async\n\nThis fixes stack overflow issues that occur when events trigger\nrecursive event chains. The fix makes all event emissions asynchronous\nusing queueMicrotask(), which breaks the synchronous call chain and\nprevents infinite recursion.\n\nChanges:\n- Modified EventEmitter.emit() to use queueMicrotask for async execution\n- This matches the pattern already used in VisualFeedbackEventBus\n- Updated all affected tests to handle async event emissions\n- Fixed jest.fn() references to use vi.fn() in migrated tests\n\nThe async pattern prevents recursion in these scenarios:\n- Command events triggering re-renders that emit more commands\n- Property changes triggering events that modify properties\n- Mode switches triggering events that switch modes\n- Event forwarding chains in CustomizationManager\n\nAll event-emitting classes that extend or use EventEmitter now\nbenefit from this protection against stack overflow.\n\nTests: 807/808 passing (1 unrelated failure about error message wording)","tree":{"sha":"a6ea43bc47054d753829dd1b0d91252aed3c2953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/a6ea43bc47054d753829dd1b0d91252aed3c2953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/e4db6bf288c8162ebead754a3f330706149aa194","verification":{"payload":"tree a6ea43bc47054d753829dd1b0d91252aed3c2953\nparent 5d1aa517e741dbe6e8efa5333ca792518e2259a6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762945874 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762945874 +0000\n\nfix: prevent stack overflow by making EventEmitter async\n\nThis fixes stack overflow issues that occur when events trigger\nrecursive event chains. The fix makes all event emissions asynchronous\nusing queueMicrotask(), which breaks the synchronous call chain and\nprevents infinite recursion.\n\nChanges:\n- Modified EventEmitter.emit() to use queueMicrotask for async execution\n- This matches the pattern already used in VisualFeedbackEventBus\n- Updated all affected tests to handle async event emissions\n- Fixed jest.fn() references to use vi.fn() in migrated tests\n\nThe async pattern prevents recursion in these scenarios:\n- Command events triggering re-renders that emit more commands\n- Property changes triggering events that modify properties\n- Mode switches triggering events that switch modes\n- Event forwarding chains in CustomizationManager\n\nAll event-emitting classes that extend or use EventEmitter now\nbenefit from this protection against stack overflow.\n\nTests: 807/808 passing (1 unrelated failure about error message wording)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPv3NtQt\nULzqrU3M/fqgwCgZ0xc3rKp6/BmQKOdbAcvRL2f2LRqRMQl9yVc6xLstQypT8oAN0cTysXkEXxbg\nPA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T11:11:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":