es of correct vs incorrect patterns\n6. PR description with full context and testing guidance\n\nThese docs ensure developers understand:\n- Why the recursion happened\n- How to avoid it in the future\n- What patterns to watch for\n- How to debug similar issues","tree":{"sha":"d75b037f9249eab47b9af6944a3fe30e7ccc3e20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/d75b037f9249eab47b9af6944a3fe30e7ccc3e20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/b418becf17164cec6e0e3d3ccc00ea29cd965e4c","verification":{"payload":"tree d75b037f9249eab47b9af6944a3fe30e7ccc3e20\nparent 81308f9bc169dd3ab696932c0ece0820b5a44476\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762936788 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762936788 +0000\n\ndocs: add comprehensive documentation for event bus recursion fix\n\nAdded detailed documentation to prevent similar issues in the future:\n\n1. Troubleshooting guide explaining the infinite recursion problem\n2. Technical deep-dive into why synchronous event buses fail with Solid.js\n3. Best practices for event buses in reactive frameworks\n4. Diagnostic steps to identify similar issues\n5. Code examples of correct vs incorrect patterns\n6. PR description with full context and testing guidance\n\nThese docs ensure developers understand:\n- Why the recursion happened\n- How to avoid it in the future\n- What patterns to watch for\n- How to debug similar issues\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOkSniQ/\n1EIxeiWHKOWWcLZRdQvpDBaMV6dpDYhIw6nqxCg2zE4iL7gZhKEF0FnGUypuw66CYHWxSjj0KdaS\nhAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-12T08:39:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","foll