s://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/83e164125d0df1b5345a599a1877d0ab83179feb","sha":"83e164125d0df1b5345a599a1877d0ab83179feb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/83e164125d0df1b5345a599a1877d0ab83179feb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/a2db9defaf0df6ab0a933f7c222410956cecd791","sha":"a2db9defaf0df6ab0a933f7c222410956cecd791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/a2db9defaf0df6ab0a933f7c222410956cecd791"}],"sha":"6c9f4e9d34f1ecc4d493e9c1f1648dbf545811e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/6c9f4e9d34f1ecc4d493e9c1f1648dbf545811e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/83e164125d0df1b5345a599a1877d0ab83179feb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-11T11:41:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-11T11:41:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: disable visual feedback system to prevent infinite recursion\n\nTemporarily disabling the visual feedback handlers entirely to isolate\nthe cause of the infinite recursion issue. The visual feedback system\nwas creating reactive loops when PropertyPanel inputs were focused.\n\nThe problem was that the visualFeedbackHandlers memo was recalculating\non every render because the handler functions (handlePropertyEditStartWithA11y\nand handlePropertyEditEndWithA11y) were being recreated with new references.\nThis caused PropertyPanel to receive new props and re-render, triggering\nthe cycle again.\n\nBy setting visualFeedback to undefined, we completely bypass the visual\nfeedback system and should stop the infinite recursion.\n\nIf this fixes the issue, we can re-enable visual feedback with a proper\nstable reference solution later.\n\nRelated: apps/dev/src/pages/Builder.tsx","tree":{"sha":"c1bf75331e3ce71870155f861995fa7a4767044d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/trees/c1bf75331e3ce71870155f861995fa7a4767044d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/git/commits/83e164125d0df1b5345a599a1877d0ab83179feb","verification":{"payload":"tree c1bf75331e3ce71870155f861995fa7a4767044d\nparent 460550f26bd572308813914d0808f85ae14356dd\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762861288 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762861288 +0000\n\nfix: disable visual feedback system to prevent infinite recursion\n\nTemporarily disabling the visual feedback handlers entirely to isolate\nthe cause of the infinite recursion issue. The visual feedback system\nwas creating reactive loops when PropertyPanel inputs were focused.\n\nThe problem was that the visualFeedbackHandlers memo was recalculating\non every render because the handler functions (handlePropertyEditStartWithA11y\nand handlePropertyEditEndWithA11y) were being recreated with new references.\nThis caused PropertyPanel to receive new props and re-render, triggering\nthe cycle again.\n\nBy setting visualFeedback to undefined, we completely bypass the visual\nfeedback system and should stop the infinite recursion.\n\nIf this fixes the issue, we can re-enable visual feedback with a proper\nstable reference solution later.\n\nRelated: apps/dev/src/pages/Builder.tsx\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJvRYl4i\nJleWmcoWKetQGnEfZTOpv6HOJxtEiDMhIw77yJJji0MEVnhie+ltaS5L4OhnZkHecSihktIxofNk\nBg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-11T11:41:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/83e164125d0df1b5345a599a1877d0ab83179feb","node_id":"C_kwDOQLsh1NoAKDgzZTE2NDEyNWQwZGYxYjUzNDVhNTk5YTE4NzdkMGFiODMxNzlmZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commit/460550f26bd572308813914d0808f85ae14356dd","sha":"460550f26bd572308813914d0808f85ae14356dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmadeiraneto/email-builder/commits/460550f26bd5723