s://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/commits/922f05563af9f00572d4d9578a9fbfb47e052a0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T02:59:39Z","email":"gizmopool@gmail.com","name":"zer0pool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T02:59:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"122.user landing page (#130)\n\n* Improve users landing page layout and formatting\n\n- Align spacing with job/table landing pages (p-4 space-y-4 instead of p-6 space-y-6)\n- Format Last Updated date to YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format (consistent with job landing)\n- Replace generic user icon with initials-based avatar (e.g., \"John Doe\" → \"JD\")\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Improve audit page layout and timestamp formatting\n\n- Adjust spacing to match users/job/table landing pages (p-4 space-y-4 instead of p-6 space-y-6)\n- Format Time column to YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format for consistency\n- Format event timestamps in expanded details to same format\n- Increase event timestamp column width for better readability\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Centralize formatDateTime utility function\n\n- Move formatDateTime from UsersPage to shared/lib/utils.ts\n- Move formatDateTime from AuditPage to shared/lib/utils.ts\n- Add JSDoc documentation with parameter descriptions\n- Support customizable fallback value (default: \"Never\")\n- Update both pages to import from utils instead of defining locally\n\nThis eliminates code duplication and makes the function available for other pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add name-based avatar color hashing for visual distinction\n\n- Add getAvatarColor() utility function with 12 diverse color palettes\n- Use simple hash function to generate consistent colors from names\n- Update Avatar component to accept name prop and apply dynamic colors\n- Update UsersPage inline avatars to use color hashing\n- Update UserDetailPage to pass user name to Avatar component\n\nColor selection is deterministic: same name always gets same color.\nHover effect now matches the avatar''s base color for consistency.\n\nSupported colors: Blue, Purple, Pink, Red, Orange, Amber, Green,\nEmerald, Teal, Cyan, Indigo, Fuchsia\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply name-based avatar to user profile menu\n\n- Replace generic User icon with initials-based avatar in navbar\n- Apply color hashing to profile menu icon and profile panel avatar\n- Support email and user ID as fallback for initials generation\n- Consistent styling: small avatar (8x8) in navbar, large avatar (16x16) in panel\n\nFalls back to external avatar image if user.picture is available.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* user landing page\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Graph Dev <graph-dev@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87845059f9c33b5d301d7d05540d47d51be6bfab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/git/trees/87845059f9c33b5d301d7d05540d47d51be6bfab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/git/commits/922f05563af9f00572d4d9578a9fbfb47e052a0b","verification":{"payload":"tree 87845059f9c33b5d301d7d05540d47d51be6bfab\nparent 160aad540de3f1e5f1e18edcb17e492804ccfd6b\nauthor zer0pool <gizmopool@gmail.com> 1777431579 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777431579 +0900\n\n122.user landing page (#130)\n\n* Improve users landing page layout and formatting\n\n- Align spacing with job/table landing pages (p-4 space-y-4 instead of p-6 space-y-6)\n- Format Last Updated date to YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format (consistent with job landing)\n- Replace generic user icon with initials-based avatar (e.g., \"John Doe\" → \"JD\")\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Improve audit page layout and timestamp formatting\n\n- Adjust spacing to match users/job/table landing pages (p-4 space-y-4 instead of p-6 space-y-6)\n- Format Time column to YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format for consistency\n- Format event timestamps in expanded details to same format\n- Increase event timestamp column width for better readability\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Centralize formatDateTime utility function\n\n- Move formatDateTime from UsersPage to shared/lib/utils.ts\n- Move formatDateTime from AuditPage to shared/lib/utils.ts\n- Add JSDoc documentation with parameter descriptions\n- Support customizable fallback value (default: \"Never\")\n- Update both pages to import from utils instead of defining locally\n\nThis eliminates code duplication and makes the function available for other pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add name-based avatar color hashing for visual distinction\n\n- Add getAvatarColor() utility function with 12 diverse color palettes\n- Use simple hash function to generate consistent colors from names\n- Update Avatar component to accept name prop and apply dynamic colors\n- Update UsersPage inline avatars to use color hashing\n- Update UserDetailPage to pass user name to Avatar component\n\nColor selection is deterministic: same name always gets same color.\nHover effect now matches the avatar''s base color for consistency.\n\nSupported colors: Blue, Purple, Pink, Red, Orange, Amber, Green,\nEmerald, Teal, Cyan, Indigo, Fuchsia\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply name-based avatar to user profile menu\n\n- Replace generic User icon with initials-based avatar in navbar\n- Apply color hashing to profile menu icon and profile panel avatar\n- Support email and user ID as fallback for initials generation\n- Consistent styling: small avatar (8x8) in navbar, large avatar (16x16) in panel\n\nFalls back to external avatar image if user.picture is available.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* user landing page\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Graph Dev <graph-dev@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8XQbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdQMQAAo7byXFvya067fz+NhXNaJu\nJ9UV7kpD2BNpF6dh0ybauipz+yInoQNeGY1MjVlnuThs7U7C+JypT4T0zJPA6L6s\nKkQhPtpdoILQmkt8Om8ebscgzqhRBGxsZ/ntbg1uA/EVxYWeIqTFKfN2DjaQ6D3a\nuABp5t9iC4xgAw6n2iCakWOxEm00diWE2Mlls9EwRwDV9rnVn7/Z9swh+7FEka7k\nHxo7Ea/K5j2pP9ucT9qR86ktidQyHZG8UUK8DopMHvFSUfmKVRlQyfBblpm3qptj\n3YZHv2EsWUeNzvmLIvuOiyUQHKNx/KHzttm2Jjo+jDxFoTpxsdE+1MTcRwMfSsVO\nR1DKRBKS2SSECntupYLd7Z+NgJjybgp8D7M2nWeLlJRMZD29hSGUyHGsax5TL8af\nRiHYBAr4zef0pB+BD7tagKvhb1c2w3jLQs/9Jd9hf/Z8JolTb1CczkHt4GWyKwM8\nr3teTX8aSAsR5+Q/D5jA10SdAmk+fzZ9yZItAU/onX2L4SS1o7bYXy3uufamigQj\nGZwWwtgCorJ1syiSr5dSsrbHanJu36LTfb9VHVR6BXcRfjpPTUe4nwmmr6wdpEJN\ngDX3RXMkS1wx0u5L7Qo5P/Hzp901VS0Kge1YRI7HMa+qH/q8RLSJSD191bxE42BP\nnblFaSlUsHH0CT//uVyr\n=xXZL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-29T02:59:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zer0pool/graph-viz/commit/922f05563af9f00572d4d9578a9fbfb47e052a0b","node_id":"C_kwDOQM7hhNoAKDkyMmYwNTU2M2FmOWYwMDU3MmQ0ZDk1NzhhOWZiZmI0N2UwNTJhMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zer0pool/graph-viz/commit/160aad540de3f1e5f1e18edcb17e492804ccfd6b","sha":"160aad540de3f1e5f1e18edcb17e492804ccfd6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/commits/160aad540de3f1e5f1e18edcb17e492804ccfd6b"}],"sha":"922f05563af9f00572d4d9578a9fbfb47e052a0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/commits/922f05563af9f00572d4d9578a9fbfb47e052a0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10063031?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zer0pool","id":10063031,"login":"zer0pool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDYzMDMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zer0pool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/commits/160aad540de3f1e5f1e18edcb17e492804ccfd6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T14:52:13Z","email":"gizmopool@gmail.com","name":"zer0pool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T14:52:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"121.table filters (#129)\n\n* Unify styles between Job Landing and Table Landing pages\n\n- Standardize spacing: p-6→p-4, space-y-6→space-y-4, gap-6→gap-4, mt-8→mt-4\n- Match GCP Console compact layout with professional SaaS density\n- Update JobLandingView: main container p-4, header mb-6, filter sidebar p-4 space-y-4\n- Unify TopLists cards: CardHeader p-3 border-b, CardTitle text-sm, content p-3 space-y-3\n- Ensure responsive design consistency with md: breakpoints\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Unify spacing and typography between Job and Table Landing pages\n\nSpacing alignment:\n- TopLists animation delay: delay-100 → delay-200 (consistent timing)\n- Table card header: p-3 gap-3 → p-4 gap-4 (unified padding/gap)\n\nTypography standardization:\n- JobLandingView header: h3 → CardTitle + CardDescription components\n- Consistent font sizes: CardTitle (text-sm), CardDescription (text-[11px])\n- Unified colors: title (text-slate-700), description (text-slate-400)\n\nStructure consistency:\n- JobLandingView: Convert table card from div to Card component\n- Apply CardContent wrapper with p-0 for proper table styling\n- Align with TableLandingView component pattern\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix TopLists wrapper and gap spacing in Table Landing\n\n- Add space-y-4 mt-4 wrapper to TableTopLists (matching JobTopLists pattern)\n- Fix loading state gap: gap-6 → gap-4 (consistent with actual rendering)\n- Ensure consistent vertical spacing between Top Lists and main table\n\nThis aligns Table Landing TopLists with Job Landing for uniform visual height\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Unify table cell padding between Job Landing and Table Landing\n\nStandardize horizontal padding from px-6 py-4 to px-4 py-2 across all table\ncells in JobLandingView to match Table Landing spacing. This creates consistent\nrow heights and visual alignment across both pages.\n\nChanges:\n- Table headers: px-6 py-4 → px-4 py-2\n- Table body cells: px-6 py-4 → px-4 py-2 (15 total instances)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Graph Dev <graph-dev@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"935b0b71ff9bf4f5afdd7944cbd812291c14d70a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/git/trees/935b0b71ff9bf4f5afdd7944cbd812291c14d70a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zer0pool/graph-viz/git/commits/160aad540de3f1e5f1e18edcb17e492804ccfd6b","verification":{"payload":"tree 935b0b71ff9bf4f5afdd7944cbd812291c14d70a\nparent 6160fb0db902a9ceefe2c5cb5896fa2368dfe9b5\nauthor zer0pool <gizmopool@gmail.com> 1775919133 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775919133 +0900\n\n121.table filters (#129)\n\n* Unify styles between Job Landing and Table Landing pages\n\n- Standardize spacing: p-6→p-4, space-y-6→space-y-4, gap-6→gap-4, mt-8→mt-4\n- Match GCP Console compact layout with professional SaaS density\n- Update JobLandingView: main container p-4, header mb-6, filter sidebar p-4 space-y-4\n- Unify TopLists cards: CardHeader p-3 border-b, CardTitle text-sm, content p-3 space-y-3\n- Ensure responsive design consistency with md: breakpoints\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Unify spacing and typography between Job and Table Landing pages\n\nSpacing alignment:\n- TopLists animation delay: delay-100 → delay-200 (consistent timing)\n- Table card header: p-3 gap-3 → p-4 gap-4 (unified padding/gap)\n\nTypography standardization:\n- JobLandingView header: h3 → CardTitle + CardDescription components\n- Consistent font sizes: CardTitle (text-sm), CardDescription (text-[11px])\n- Unified colors: title (text-slate-700), description (text-slate-400)\n\nStructure consistency:\n- JobLandingView: Convert table card from div to Card component\n- Apply CardContent wrapper with p-0 for proper table styling\n- Align with TableLandingView component pattern\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix TopLists wrapper and gap spacing in Table Landing\n\n- Add space-y-4 mt-4 wrapper to TableTopLists (matching JobTopLists pattern)\n- Fix loading state gap: gap-6 → gap-4 (consistent with actual rendering)\n- Ensure consistent vertical spacing between Top Lists and main table\n\nThis aligns Table Landing TopLists with Job Landing for uniform visual height\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Unify table cell padding between Job Landing and Table Landing\n\nStandardize horizontal padding from px-6 py-4 to px-4 py-2 across all table\ncells in JobLandingView to match Table Landing spacing. This creates consistent\nrow heights and visual alignment across both pages.\n\nChanges:\n- Table headers: px-6 py-4 → px-4 py-2\n- Table body cells: px-6 py-4 → px-4 py-2 (15 total instances)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Graph Dev <graph-dev@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2mAdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOQcQAAdNQqYVICtx7oST9gWF92eB\ne8f5PXI5Ij2CNPCXz89nr8I51NLp0uSAcKv+S4aApgIOxySPzXuXpmJw+BVqXpqG\nx77K6GPibLbY/v7b+41SrofPVO0/fcFbXpmvNUUmsLXxgg1CGHJ53nwIuK6ELIFM\nkriBG8ueFKhHeqfEI5YH9mmR9i+Q+JI5mw/bxZi7IzOyN5VQv7FOc5Xf0J3sYa7x\nmk9sdHjFSf9s+/0oBNxC503K7JeNtaACx25nnNJGMeJKzKOHWURUQob9tAMIfXcu\nttCQEqZHne6d6h8hiVbXj4w0Ub5IppidFTLen9oEFWYvUODx8vM3tqVeuYtLovCY\neV1xo32ZHgYopTNs3rW7Oln+4PmY602yzBSuU+7kviCukFXp4VoDyyYDSnAt5E2f\nw5/26sk/AtECCGLHVO7n6F4pHrw81tZSrzxMkYMC+RP4xE4ty8fL80aRDNyXpYY1\nV+JVFz6MljSsieVKp1rbsiBnpnar22oNi7I4cvm6WNvptYfGewcCxJ1m6dWExrSs\nwiK7BZ+6eBghh8Gu0yv9pCBXih1N4hm2Ui3Of3Dm3MikZXLgEX8uZ7JwQoub9Ufe\nQJ1zPl5VouZNHztkhYpWDZfAsExX8JS929wUurzsFyoKuaAjEC9N+Eh9Dl